<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Marqus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrq</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marqus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aseȓmeḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lkitab n Marqus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aseȓmeḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="mt3">Lkitab n Marqus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Siḏna Yaḥya isewjaḏ abriḏ i Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Amezwaru n Lʼinjil n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Mmis n Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab n nnabi Icaƹya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">&lt;<char style="bd">Aqa tsekkiɣ-d ij n arrasul inu zzaṯec, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="bd">ḥima aḏ isewjeḏ abriḏ nnec. </char><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <char style="bd">Ṯmijja tȓaɣa ḏi ȓexȓa: </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="bd">Swejḏeṯ abriḏ i Siḏi Arebbi, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="bd">ggeṯ ibriḏen nnes nican.&gt; </char><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yusa-d Yaḥya ɣar ȓexȓa. Itbeccar iwḏan ḥima aḏ tuben aḏ twaṭehharen s waman ḥima aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Tasen-d ɣares marra imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya ḏ marra imezḏaɣ n ṯendint n Lquds, teƹtarafen s ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen, Yaḥya itṭehhar-iṯen s waman ḏeg yiɣzar n Lʼurdun. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Arruḍ n Yaḥya xeḏmen-ṯ s cƹar n uȓɣem, x nneṣṣ nnes ijjen n uḥezzam n yiȓem. Itett ṯmurɣi ḏ ṯamment ṯaḥurrect. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Itḥeddaṯ iqqar: "Menbaƹd i nec aḏ d yas ijjen ijheḏ xafi, war sḏihiǧeɣ nec aḏ aḏreɣ ḥima aḏas fesyeɣ uȓa ḏ ifiȓan n ṯsiȓa nnes. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nec ṭehhareɣ-kenniw s waman, netta akenniw iṭehhar s Arruḥ iqeddsen."<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏna Yaḥya itṭehhar i Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa s waman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ḏi ȓiyyam nni yusa-d Ƹisa zeg ubilaj n Naṣira iy iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil, iṭehhar-iṯ Yaḥya s waman ḏeg yiɣzar n Lʼurdun. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Wami d yuȓi zeg waman, ȓexddenni iẓra ajenna inurzem, ḏ Arruḥ n Arebbi ihewwa-d xas igga am yijjen n ṯeḏbirṯ. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ḏ ijjen n ṯmijja zeg ujenna ṯeqqar: "Cek ḏ Memmi iƹizzen, nec farrḥeɣ zzayek."<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ȓexddenni yuwi-ṯ Arruḥ nni ɣar ȓexȓa. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Ikka ḏinni arbeƹin yum itjerrab-iṯ Cciṭan. Aqaṯ mani ǧan ȓuwḥuc, tsexxarent xas lmalaʼikaṯ.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itȓaɣa-d i imeḥḍaren nnes imezwura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Wami ḥebbsen Yaḥya, yuyur Ƹisa iruḥ ɣar ṯmurṯ n Ljalil itbeccar ḏinni s Lʼinjil n Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Iqqar-asen: Aqa ȓweqṯ ṯuweḍ-d, ȓmulk n Arebbi yuḏes-d. Tubeṯ, amneṯ s Lʼinjil.<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ƹisa wami iggur x cceṭṭ n ȓebḥar n Ljalil, iẓra Simƹan ḏ wumas Andrus neṭṭaren ṯracca ḏi ȓebḥar minzi niṯni ḏ iḥeǧaqen n iseȓman. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ḏfarem-ayi-d, aqa ȓexxu iy kenniw ɣa arreɣ ḏ iḥeǧaqen n yiwḏan." <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ȓexddenni semḥen ḏi ṯracciwin nsen ḏfaren-ṯ. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Iƹḏu cwayt aɣirin, iẓra Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna niṯni ḏ ṯarwa n Zabadi, aqaṯen ḏi ṯɣarrabut ƹeddȓen ṯiracciwin. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ȓexddenni iȓaɣa-yasen-d Ƹisa, semḥen ḏi babaṯsen Zabadi ig iǧan ḏi ṯɣarrabut ak ixeddamen nnes, ḏfaren-ṯ.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isufuɣ ijjen n jjenn ḏ aƹeffan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Uḏfen ɣar ubilaj n Kafernaḥum. Ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada yuḏef Ƹisa ḏi ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil ibḏa iseȓmaḏ ḏinni. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Tƹejjben ḏeg useȓmeḏ nnes ȓaḥeqqac ɣares ssulṭa iy zi iseȓmaḏ, war iǧi bu amecnaw imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ȓexddenni ufin ḏi ṯemziḏa nni ijjen n bnaḏem ḏayes jjenn ḏ aƹeffan. Iȓaɣa s jjheḏ jjenn nni <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />inna-as: "Min ṯrezzuḏ zzayneɣ a Ƹisa Naṣiri? Ma ṯusiḏ-d axaneɣ ṯeqḍiḏ? Nec qa ssneɣ min ṯeƹniḏ; cek ḏ Lƹaḍim n Arebbi!"<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Inha-ṯ Ƹisa inna-as: "Stuk cek, ffeɣ zzayes!"<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Iserjijay-iṯ jjenn nni aƹeffan iƹeyyeḍ s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯemɣar iffeɣ zzayes. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ḏehcen marra iwḏan nni nnan i wayawya: "Min iƹna manaya? Aseȓmeḏ-a ḏ jḏiḏ, ḏayes ssulṭa! Itʼamar uȓa ḏ jnun iƹeffanen, teggen-as array." <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ȓexddenni intacar ȓexbar nnes ḏi mkuȓ amcan ḏi jwayeh n Ljalil.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ṯaḏeggwaȓṯ n Simƹan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Wami d iffeɣ zi ṯemziḏa nni, yusa-d ɣar ṯeddarṯ n Simƹan ḏ Andrus akiḏes Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Yufa ṯaḏeggwaȓṯ n Simƹan ṯezzeȓ ḏi ṯassuṯ ḏayes ṯimessi. Ȓexddenni ƹawḏen-as xas. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Iqarreb ɣares iṭṭef-it zeg ufus nnes isgaƹƹeḏ-it-id. Ṯeffeɣ-it ṯmessi, ṯekkar ṯebḏa tsexxar xasen.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Wami ṯeɣȓi ṯfuct ɣar ṯmeddiṯ, uwin-d ɣares marra yinni iheȓcen ḏ yinni ḏi ǧan jnun, <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />munen marra ayṯbab n ubilaj ḏinni ɣar ṯewwarṯ. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Isgenfa aṭṭas n imehȓac ḏaysen lʼanwaƹ n ȓehȓacaṯ. Isufeɣ aṭṭas n jnun, war ṯen ijji ca aḏ ssiwȓen minzi jnun-a ssnen min iƹna.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ṯiwecca nnes zic wami ƹaḏ war iṣbiḥ ca ȓḥaȓ, ikkar iffeɣ iruḥ ɣar yijjen n umcan ixȓa, itẓaǧa ḏinni. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Irzu xas Simƹan ḏ yinni kiḏes iǧan. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Wami ṯ ufin nnan-as: "Marra rezzun xak."<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Inna-asen: "Yallahiṯ akiḏi, a nraḥ ɣar ȓedcuraṯ nneɣni yuḏsen ḥima aḏ ḥeddṯeɣ uȓa ḏinni. X manaya mixef d usiɣ." <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Iruḥ itḥeddaṯ ḏi ṯemziḏawin n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi marra ṯamurṯ n Ljalil isufuɣ jnun.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ijjen ihȓec s jḏam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Yusa-d ɣar Ƹisa ijjen ihȓec ḏayes jḏam. Iwḍa x ifadden nnes iḥeccem-iṯ inna-as: "Cek meȓa ṯexseḏ, ṯzemmareḏ aḏayi ṯessiṣfiḏ."<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Iqqes-as i Ƹisa, iḥaḏa-ṯ s ufus nnes inna-as: "Wah nec xseɣ, cek qa ṯgenfiḏ!"<verse eid="MRK 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ḏeg umcan ikkes-as jḏam nni iḏweȓ iṣfa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Ȓexddenni issekk-iṯ Ƹisa iweṣṣa-ṯ aṭṭas <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />inna-as: "Xzar, war txebbar ḥadd." Inna-as: "Ruḥ ɣar ȓefqi seḍhar-as ixef nnec. Egg ṣṣeḏqeṯ nni iy zi iweṣṣa Musa ḥima aɣarsen ṯiȓi chaḏeṯ x min iweqƹen."<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Walakin netta min igga? Iruḥ ibḏa issawaȓ aṭṭas, isufeɣ ȓexbar aȓ wami iḏweȓ Ƹisa war izemmar aḏ yaḏef ɣar ca n ubilaj bȓa ma aḏ isnuffar ixef nnes. Tuɣa labud itɣima ḏeg imucan ixwan, walakin waxxa amenni iwḏan tasen-d ɣares ḏinni zi marra imucan.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ijjen n unecruf</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Menbaƹd i can wussan, iḏweȓ-d Ƹisa ƹaweḏ ɣar ubilaj n Kafernaḥum sȓin iwḏan belli aqaṯ ḏi ṯeddarṯ. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Munen aṭṭas n ȓɣaci iƹemmar ȓḥaȓ aȓ wami war iqqim uȓa ḏ ijjen n umcan waxxa zzaṯ i ṯewwarṯ. Issawaȓ akiḏsen Ƹisa s wawar n Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Usin-d can yiwḏan uwin-as-d ijjen n uryaz mmuṯen-as iḍaren, ysin-ṯ arbeƹa iḏsen <char style="it">x ṯassuṯ nnes</char>. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />War zemmiren ca aṯ siḏfen ɣar Ƹisa minzi ḏinni aṭṭas n ȓɣaci. Qeȓƹen ssqef cwayt rezmen-ṯ, sehwan anecruf nni x ṯassuṯ nnes <char style="it">ɣar uxxam mani iǧa Ƹisa</char>.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Wami iẓra Ƹisa lʼiman nsen, inna-as i unecruf nni: "A mmi twaɣfarent-ac ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnec."<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Can imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa iy iqqimen ḏinni tfekkaren nnan ḏeg wuȓawen nsen: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />"Mammec issawaȓ bnaḏem-a ammu? Iqqar awaȓ war iḥȓin x Arebbi. Ug izemmaren aḏ iɣfar ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ illa Arebbi waḥḏes!?"<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ḏeɣya issen Ƹisa ḏi nnefs nnes min tfekkaren ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen inna-asen: "Mayemmi tfekkarem ammu kenniw ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Min isehȓen aṭṭas aḏas iniɣ i unecruf-a, ma aḏas iniɣ: Twaɣfarent-ac ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnec? Niɣ ma aḏas iniɣ: Kkar cek, ysi ṯassuṯ nnec uyur? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Nec xseɣ aḏ tessnem belli Mmis n bnaḏem ɣares ssulṭa x ṯmurṯ ḥima aḏ iɣfar ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ." Uca inna-as Ƹisa i unecruf nni: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />"Aḏac iniɣ, bedd x iḍaren nnec ysi ṯassuṯ nnec ruḥ aḏ trewwḥeḏ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnec!"<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Ȓexddenni ibedd x iḍaren nnes iysi ṯassuṯ nnes iffeɣ zzaṯ i yiwḏan marra. Qqimen kuȓci ḏehhcen ḥemmḏen Arebbi nnan: "Ƹemmarṣ ma neẓra manaya iwqeƹ zi qbeȓ."<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itȓaɣa-d i Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Iffeɣ Ƹisa ƹaweḏ ɣar ṭṭarf n ȓebḥar, usin-d ɣares marra ȓɣaci iseȓmaḏ-iṯen ḏinni. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Wami iƹḏu ssenni, yufa Lawi mmis n Ḥalfa iqqim ɣar missa ḏeg umcan mani jemmƹen ḍḍariba. Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ḏfar-ayi-d." Uca ikkar iḏfar-iṯ.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Iqqim Ƹisa ḏi ṯeddarṯ n Lawi, itett netta ḏ imeḥḍaren nnes. Aṭṭas n iƹeccaren ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan zaƹma qqimen tetten akiḏes ȓaḥeqqac aṭṭas n yiwḏan iy ṯ iḏeffaren. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Can imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ufin Ƹisa itett ak iƹeccaren<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Min ƹennan iƹeccaren? Niṯni zi Ayṯ-Israʼil xeddmen ak ȓmexzen n arrumanus jemmƹen ḍḍariba zi ayṯmaṯsen. Israʼiliyen nneḍni qqaren belli iƹeccaren ƹeṣṣan aṭṭas. Ƹaweḏ azyen ameqqran n iƹeccaren arennin ci ḥaja ḥima aṯent ysin i yixef nsen.</char></note> ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan zaƹma, nnan i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Mayemmi itett netta ak iƹeccaren ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan?"<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Isȓa-yasen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Iwḏan iṣeḥḥan war teḥḏijin bu uḍbib, aḍbib teḥḏajan-ṯ imehȓac." Inna-asen: "Nec war d usiɣ ca aḏ ȓaɣiɣ i yinni iǧan nican, usiɣ-d ɣar yinni iƹeṣṣan."<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tseqsan Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa x ṯẓumiṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Tuɣa imeḥḍaren n Yaḥya ḏ imeḥḍaren n ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen niṯni tẓumman. Usin-d yiwḏan ɣar Ƹisa nnan-as: "Mayemmi imeḥḍaren n Yaḥya ḏ imeḥḍaren n ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen tẓumman, imeḥḍaren nnec war tẓummin ca?"<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Imeddukaȓ n muȓay, ma zemmaren aḏ ẓummen ḏi nhar nni n ȓfarḥ nnes? Lla, xmi itiȓi muȓay akiḏsen war zemmaren aḏ ẓummen. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Walakin aḏ d asen wussan aḏ imeysi muȓay zi ȓwesṭ nsen, ȓexddenni aḏ ẓummen ḏi nhar nni.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />War iǧi ḥadd itreqqaƹ arruḍ ḏ ȓbaȓi s yijjen n ṯreqqiƹṯ n ttub ḏ jḏiḏ, mayemmi? Ȓaḥeqqac ṯareqqiƹṯ nni n ttub ḏ jḏiḏ aḏ tnejmeƹ aḏ twakkes zeg warruḍ nni ḏ ȓbaȓi. Ȓexddenni aḏ iqqim ucarrig imɣar! <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Uȓa ḏ aman n uḍiȓ ḏ jḏiḏ war xeǧqen ca ḏeg yiȓemawen iqḏimen, ḥima war dduqquzen war tzeǧiƹen ca waman n uḍiȓ aḏ ḍeyyƹen yiȓemawen nni. Walakin aman n uḍiȓ ḏ jḏiḏ xeǧqen ḏeg yiȓemawen ḏ jḏiḏ."<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Min iǧan ḥalal ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ijjen n nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada, iƹḏu Ƹisa ḏeg ubriḏ ḏi ȓwesṭ n imendi, gguren akiḏes imeḥḍaren nnes bḏan tekksen ṯiyḏerin. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Nnan-as ȓebƹaḍ zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen: "Xzar! Mayemmi imeḥḍaren nnec teggen min iǧan ḥram ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada?"<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ma war ṯeɣrim ca min igga Dawed wami iḥḏaj, iǧuz netta ḏ yinni akiḏes? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Yuḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa n Arebbi ḏi zman n Abyaṯar arrayes n ȓfuqaha, yufa ḏinni aɣrum nni iy iǧan ḏ ṣṣeḏqeṯ icca netta yuca-asen i yinni akiḏes; waxxa manayenni war iǧi ca ḥalal ɣir i ȓfuqaha waha."<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Uca inna-asen: "Nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada itwaxȓeq i ssabab n bnaḏem, maci ḏ bnaḏem itwaxeȓqen i ssabab n nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ȓaḥeqqac Mmis n bnaḏem ig iǧan ḏ lḥakem ḥetta x nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada."<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ij uryaz ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yuḏef Ƹisa ƹaweḏ ɣar yijjen n ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil yufa ḏinni ijjen n uryaz fus nnes immuṯ. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Tlaḥaḍen xas ma aṯ isgenfa ma lla ḏi nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada ḥima aṯ tahmen. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Inna-as Ƹisa i uryaz nni iy ɣar iǧa fus immuṯ: "Bedd ḏi ȓwesṭ." <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Isseqsa-ṯen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Nhar n lƹibada ma ḥalal a negg ȓxir niɣ a negg ccarr? A nsenjem nnefs niɣ aṯ nneɣ?" Walakin niṯni sqaren. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Ixzar ɣarsen iƹeṣṣeb, ixeyyeq ȓaḥeqqac uȓawen nsen qesḥen. Inna-as i uryaz nni: "Sarreḥ fus nnec." Isarreḥ-iṯ uca iḏweȓ ufus nnes igenfa. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ȓexddenni ffɣen ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen munen ak yiwḏan zi ȓḥizeb n uzeǧiḏ Hirudus, mcawaren mammec iy ɣa ggen aḏ nɣen Ƹisa.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aṭṭas n yiwḏan ḏeffaren Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Iffeɣ Ƹisa ak imeḥḍaren nnes ihwa ɣar cceṭṭ n ȓebḥar, iḏfar-iṯen ijjen n lƹadad ḏ ameqqran n yiwḏan zi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil ḏ ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ḏ ṯendint n Lquds ḏ ṯmurṯ n Idumya ḏ ujemmaḍ-in i yiɣzar n Lʼurdun, ƹaweḏ zi jwayeh n Ṣur ḏ Ṣayda. Usin-d ɣares aṭṭas n ȓɣaci wami d arrin ȓexbar i marra min igga.<verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: Swejḏem-ayi ijjen n ṯɣarrabut ḥima war xafi temziḥimen ȓɣaci-ya. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Minzi netta tuɣa isgenfa aṭṭas n yiwḏan aȓ wami marra yinni ḏi iǧa ȓeḥriq mzaḥamen xas, xsen aṯ ḥaḏan. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Jnun iƹeffanen meȓmi ma ẓrin Ƹisa, weṭṭan ɣar iḍaren nnes snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ qqaren: "A cek ḏ Mmis n Arebbi." <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Iweṣṣa-ṯen Ƹisa aṭṭas inna-asen: "War ssawaȓeṯ ca ḥima war twassineɣ ca."<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ixḍar ṯenƹac n arrusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Igaƹƹeḏ Ƹisa ɣar uḏrar iȓaɣa-d x yinni ixes uca usin-d ɣares. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ixḍar zzaysen ṯenƹac, iggi-ṯen ḏ arrusul ḥima akiḏes iȓin aṯen issekk aḏ ḥeddṯen, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />aɣarsen ṯiȓi ssulṭa ḥima aḏ sufɣen jnun. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ṯenƹac-a ig igga niṯni ḏ Simƹan, isemma-ṯ Buṭrus, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna ṯarwa n Zabadi, isemma-ṯen Bunarges (manaya ixes aḏ yini ṯarwa n wajjaj), <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />ḏ Andrus, ḏ Filippas, ḏ Bartulumay, ḏ Matta, ḏ Tuma, ḏ Yaƹqub mmis n Ḥalfa, ḏ Taddi, ḏ Simƹan umi qqaren &lt;Lmunaḍil&gt;, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ḏ Yahuḏa Isxaryuṭi iƹni wenni izzenzen Ƹisa.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itwajah yinni iǧan ḍed nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Irewweḥ-d Ƹisa ɣar ṯeddarṯ, munen-d ƹaweḏ ȓɣaci aȓ wami war izemmar Ƹisa ḏ imeḥḍaren nnes aḏ ccen uȓa ḏ aɣrum. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Wami sȓin ȓeḥbab nnes x manaya, usin-d ḥima aṯ awin akiḏsen nnan qa iruḥ-as ȓaƹqeȓ.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa iy d yusin zi Lquds nnan: "Ḏayes Bƹalzabul arrayes n jnun. Isufuɣ jnun minzi <char style="it">Bƹalzabul</char> yuca-yas jjheḏ-a."<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Iȓaɣa-d xasen Ƹisa issiweȓ akiḏsen s ȓemƹani inna-asen: "Mammec igga Cciṭan aḏ isufeɣ Cciṭan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Lmemlaka iy ḏi tmenɣan ayṯbab nnes ijjen ak unneɣni war ṯzemmar aḏ teqqim. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ṯaddarṯ iy ḏi tmenɣan ayṯbab nnes ijjen ak unneɣni war ṯzemmar aḏ teqqim. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Meȓa Cciṭan ikkar aḏ iqḍa x Cciṭan, war itɣimi ca, aḏ ifna. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />War izemmar ḥadd aḏ ihjem x ṯeddarṯ n can yijjen ijheḏ bac aḏ yacar agȓa nnes illa meȓa icedd-iṯ ḏ amezwaru. Uca aḏas yawi marra min ɣares ḏi ṯeddarṯ. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Aḏ twaɣfarent marra ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ iy teggen yiwḏan ḏ kuȓ awaȓ nni war iḥȓin iy qqaren x Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Walakin wenni ɣa yinin can wawaȓ war iḥȓin x Arruḥ iqeddsen, war ḏas iɣeffar lla ḏi ddunect-a u lla ḏi lʼaxira." <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Minzi qqaren qa <char style="it">Ƹisa</char> ḏayes ijjen n jjenn ḏ aƹeffan.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ṯusa-d ɣares yemmas ḏ ayṯmas, bedden barra <char style="it">i ṯeddarṯ</char> ssekken ɣares ȓaɣan-d xas. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ȓɣaci nni qqimen nnḍen-as nnan-as: "Aqa yemmac ḏ ayṯmac ḏ suyṯmac ḏi barra rezzun xak." <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Indeq-d inna-asen: "Min ƹnan yemma ḏ ayṯma?" <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ixzar ɣar yinni iqqimen nnḍen-as uca inna: "Aqa yemma ḏ ayṯma." <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" /><char style="it">Inna-asen:</char> "Wenni iteggen s min ixes Arebbi, ataf netta ḏ uma ḏ učma ḏ yemma."<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n wenni izerrƹen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ƹaweḏ ibḏa Ƹisa iseȓmaḏ x ṭṭarf n ȓebḥar. Munen-d xas aṭṭas n ȓɣaci, ikkar netta inya ḏeg yijjen n ṯɣarrabut ḏi ȓwesṭ n waman iqqim ḏayes, iwḏan qqimen marra ḏi ȓbarr x ṭṭarf n ȓebḥar. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Iseȓmaḏ-asen aṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin s ȓemƹani. Inna-asen ḏeg useȓmeḏ nnes: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />"Ṣennṭeṯ, iffeɣ ufeǧaḥ aḏ izreƹ. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Wami izerreƹ, ṯewḍa-yas can zzarriƹeṯ x ṭṭarf n ubriḏ, usin-d ijḍaḍ ccin-teṯ. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Can zzarriƹeṯ ṯewḍa-yas jar yizra war ḏinni bu caȓ aṭṭas. Ṯeɣmi-d ḏeɣya ȓaḥeqqac war ṯuǧiɣ ca ḏi ṯmurṯ aṭṭas. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Walakin wami ṯsummar ṯfuct, ṯnezȓef ȓexddenni ṯisraw ȓaḥeqqac iẓewran nnes war uwṯin ca ɣar ȓaǧeɣ n ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Can zzarriƹeṯ ṯewḍa jar isennanen. Ɣmin-d akiḏes isennanen nni jeyyfen-teṯ war ṯeggi bu ṯiyḏerin. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Walakin can zzarriƹeṯ ṯewḍa x ṯmurṯ ṯaṣebḥant, ṯuȓi-d ṯemɣar ṯegga ṯiyḏerin. Ȓebƹaḍ ggint ṯȓaṯin, ȓebƹaḍ ggint settin, ȓebƹaḍ ggint miyya." <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Uca inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan."<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asfhem n ȓmaƹna n wenni izerrƹen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Wami Ƹisa iqqim waḥḏes, sseqsan-ṯ yinni ḏas innḍen ak ṯenƹac n imeḥḍaren x ȓemƹani-ya. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Inna-asen: "Itwasmeḥ i kenniw <char style="it">aḏ tessnem</char> min inuffaren ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi. Yinni zi barra marra tas-asen-d s ȓemƹani waha:<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />&lt;Waxxa xezzaren, war twiȓin ca.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Waxxa tesȓan, war fehhmen i ca war tubin ca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">war ḏasen twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen.&gt;"<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Inna-asen: "Ma war ṯefhimem ȓmaƹna-ya? Iwa, mammec ɣa ṯfehmem marra ȓemƹani? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Afeǧaḥ netta izerreƹ awaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan x ubriḏ nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi. Itraḥ Cciṭan ḏeɣya itekkes awaȓ nni itwazerƹen ḏaysen <char style="it">ḏeg wuȓ</char>. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan jar yizra nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi, qebȓen-ṯ s ȓefraḥeṯ. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Wami war uwṯin bu iẓewran mliḥ ḏeɣya tneqȓaƹen. Xmi d tasent can ȓemḥayen niɣ ḏ can uƹeddeb x ssabab n wawaȓ n Arebbi, ḏeɣya teffɣen abriḏ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan jar isennanen nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ḏaysen amnus n ddunect, icemmeṯ-iṯen ṭṭmaƹ n wagȓa, ḏaysen ccehawaṯ n ṯmesȓayin nneɣni, ssenni itwajeyyef wawaȓ n Arebbi war ineffeƹ ca. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Walakin zzarriƹeṯ nni ig iwḍan ḏi ṯmurṯ ṯaṣebḥant nettaṯ am yiwḏan iy tesȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi qebȓen-ṯ tarwen. Ȓebƹaḍ tarwen ṯȓaṯin, ȓebƹaḍ settin, ȓebƹaḍ miyya."<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ȓqendiȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Inna-asen: "Uȓa ḏ ijjen war d itiwi ȓqendiȓ ḥima axas iqȓeb aqnuc niɣ aṯ igg swadday i qama; Lla, itegg-iṯ x ȓmarfaƹ. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Aqa marra min inuffaren aḏ d imeḍhar. Marra min itwasnuffaren aḏ inefḍeḥ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan."<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Inna-asen: "Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem i min tesȓam. Ȓaƹbar iy ṯsexḏamem ḏ wenni iy kiḏwem ɣa isexḏem Arebbi u ƹaḏ ktar. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ȓaḥeqqac wenni iǧan ɣares itmarni-yas. Walakin wenni war ɣar iǧi ca, itwaksi-yas uȓa ḏ min ɣares."<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n zzarriƹeṯ itemɣuren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Inna-asen Ƹisa ƹaweḏ: "Ȓmulk n Arebbi igga am yijjen n bnaḏem izerreƹ zzarriƹeṯ ḏi ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Iteṭṭeṣ s ǧiȓeṯ itfaq-d ag ṣbaḥ itaf zzarriƹeṯ tgaƹƹaḏ temɣur. Netta war issin ca mammec iwqeƹ manayenni. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Minzi ṯamurṯ ticc ṯiḥebba nnes nniṯ. Ḏ amezwaru ṯɣemmi-d, ṯḏewweȓ ḏ ṯiyḏerin, ṯiyḏerin nni tƹemmarent s ṯḥebba. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Walakin ɣir aḏ iwjeḏ imendi, ȓexddenni aḏ iffeɣ aḏ imjar minzi ȓweqṯ n umjar ṯuweḍ-d."<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n bugarḏaȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Inna-asen ƹaweḏ: "Minḏi itcabbah ȓmulk n Arebbi? Niɣ s minzi ɣa ṯ nmeṯṯel? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ȓmulk n Arebbi igga am yijjen n zzarriƹeṯ n yijjen n nnuƹ n arbiƹ qqaren-as bugarḏaȓ. Xmi t zerƹen ḏi ṯmurṯ tiȓi ḏ ṯamezyant qaƹ x marra ṯiḥebba iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Walakin xmi t zerƹen, temɣar ṯḏewweȓ ḏ ṯameqqrant zi marra arbiƹ n ȓƹarseṯ tegg ȓefruƹ ḏ imeqqranen. Uȓa ḏ ijḍaḍ tasen-d teggen ḏayes ȓaƹwac nsen ḏi ṯiȓi nnes."<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Issawaȓ Ƹisa ak ȓɣaci s waṭṭas n ȓemƹani am yina ƹlaḥsab min zemmaren aḏ fehmen. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />War kiḏsen issiwiȓ ca illa s ȓemƹani, walakin imeḥḍaren nnes isefham-iṯen mliḥ xmi itiȓi akiḏsen waḥḏes.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ihedden ȓebḥar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Nhar nni wami d ṯuweḍ ṯmeddiṯ, inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Yallah a neẓwam ɣar ujemmaḍ-in." <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Wami semḥen ḏi ȓɣaci, iruḥ Ƹisa akiḏsen ḏi ṯɣarrabut nni iy ḏi iǧa ƹaḏ. Akiḏes ḏinni ṯiɣarruba nneɣni. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ikkar-d ijjen n arriḥ ijheḏ aṭṭas ḏi ȓebḥar, ȓemwaj ccaṯent ṯaɣarrabut nni aȓ wami ṯebḏa tƹemmar s waman. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Netta iǧa ɣar puppa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Puppa qqaren-t i ḏeffar n ṯɣarrabut.</char></note> n ṯɣarrabut iṭṭeṣ isummeṯ ijjen n ṯsunta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯsunta nettaṯ ḏ ṯsummet.</char></note> Sfaqen-ṯ imeḥḍaren nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim, ma war c ithimi ca manaya? Aqa neccin netmetta!" <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Ikkar isbedd arriḥ inna-as i ȓebḥar: "Sqar, qḍeƹ ȓḥiss!" Uca ibedd arriḥ irsa ȓḥaȓ. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Inna-asen: "Mayemmi teggwḏem qaƹ ammu? Ma ƹaḏ war ḏaywem bu lʼiman?" <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ggwḏen aṭṭas nnan i wayawya: "Min iƹna wanitan? Uȓa ḏ arriḥ ḏ ȓebḥar tṭaƹan-as!"<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Ijjen ḏayes jnun ḏi ṯmurṯ n ijariṯiyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Iẓwa Ƹisa ɣar ujemmaḍ-in n ȓebḥar ɣar ṯmurṯ n ijariṯiyen. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Wami iḍra zi ṯɣarrabut iȓqa ijjen n uryaz ḏayes jjenn ḏ aƹeffan yusa-d zeg imeḍȓan. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Izeddeɣ ḏinni ḏeg imeḍȓan. War izemmar uȓa ḏ ijjen aṯ iqqen waxxa s snaseȓ. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin carrfen-ṯ zeg ifassen ḏ iḍaren s snaseȓ ḏ leqtina, walakin iqeṭṭew snaseȓ itrezza leqtina. War izemmar uȓa ḏ ijjen aṯ iṭṭef. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Itiȓi ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar ḏeg imeḍȓan ḏ iḏurar isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ ijarreḥ ixef nnes s uzru. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Wami iẓra Ƹisa zi ȓeggwaj, yuzzeȓ ɣares isejjeḏ-as. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Indeq-d s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯejheḏ inna-as: "A Ƹisa a Mmis n Arebbi yuƹȓan, min ṯexseḏ zzayi? Tettareɣ zzayek i Arebbi ḥima war ḏayi tƹeddibeḏ ca!" <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" /><char style="it">Inna manaya</char> minzi Ƹisa tuɣa inna-as: "A jjenn aƹeffan ffeɣ zeg uryaz-a!"<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Isseqsa-ṯ Ƹisa inna-as: "Mammec ḏac qqaren?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Inna-as: "Nec qqaren-ayi Aberru minzi neccin aṭṭas iḏneɣ." <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Iḥeccem-iṯ aṭṭas ḥima war ṯen issekki barra i jjiheṯ nni. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ḏinni ijjen n ṯḥimerṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant n yiȓfan ṯarwes x uḏrar. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ttaren zzayes jnun nni nnan-as: "Sekk-aneɣ ɣar yiȓfan-in ḥima aḏaysen naḏef." <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Wami ṯen ijja, ffɣen jnun nni iƹeffanen uḏfen ḏeg yiȓfan nni. Ṯuzzeȓ ṯḥimerṯ nni ṯehwa x uḏrar ɣar ȓebḥar ṯeɣreq ḏinni. Tuɣa lƹadad nsen ƹȓayen aȓefayen.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Yinni yarewwsen arewȓen sufɣen ȓexbar ḏi ṯendint ḏ ȓedcuraṯ. Ffɣen-d yiwḏan ḥima aḏ xzaren min iweqƹen. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Usin-d ɣar Ƹisa ufin aryaz nni iy ḏi tuɣa iǧa aberru n jnun yareḍ arruḍ nnes iqqim igenfa s ȓaƹqeȓ nnes. Uca ggwḏen aṭṭas. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Xbaren-ṯen ȓechuḏ x min iweqƹen i uryaz nni iy ḏi tuɣa ǧan jnun ḏ min ḏasen iweqƹen i yiȓfan. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Uca bḏan tettaren zzayes ḥima axasen ibeƹƹeḏ zi jjiheṯ nsen.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Wami tuɣa innay ḏi ṯɣarrabut, ittar zzayes uryaz nni iy ḏi tuɣa ǧan jnun inna-as: "Ejj-ayi akic raḥeɣ." <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Walakin Ƹisa yugi, inna-as: "Ruḥ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnec ḏ ȓeḥbab nnec sxebbar-iṯen s min ḏac igga Siḏi Arebbi ḏ mammec cek irḥem." <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Iruḥ uryaz nni ibḏa itxebbar ḏi lʼiqlim umi qqaren Dikaplis zi min ḏas igga Ƹisa. Qqimen iwḏan nni marra ḏehhcen.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa yeǧis n Yagrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Wami iḏweȓ Ƹisa ḏi ṯɣarrabut ɣar jjiheṯ nni manis d yusa, munen-d xas ȓɣaci ḏ ameqqran x cceṭṭ n ȓebḥar. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Yusa-d ɣares ijjen zi arruyas n ṯemziḏa n Ayṯ-Israʼil qqaren-as Yagrus. Wami iẓra Ƹisa iwḍa-yas ɣar iḍaren nnes <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />iḥeccem-iṯ aṭṭas inna-as qa yeǧi ṯamezyant aqa tmetta. Araḥ-d sers xas ifassen nnec ḥima aḏ tgenfa aḏ teddar. <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Iruḥ akiḏes ḏfaren-ṯ aṭṭas n ȓɣaci temzaḥamen xas.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ḏinni ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯenƹac iseggwusa zeg wami iy ṯehȓec tazzeȓ s iḏammen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Ṯƹeddeb aṭṭas x ifassen n waṭṭas n iḍbiben. Marra min ɣares ḏ agȓa ṯḍeyyeƹ-iṯ bȓa nnfaƹ. Waxxa amenni lḥala nnes ṯarni. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Tesȓa x Ƹisa ṯeḏfar-iṯ ak ȓɣaci ṯḥaḏa-yas aseȓham nnes. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ṯenna ḏeg wuȓ nnes aqa meȓa ḥaḏiɣ ɣir aseȓham nnes ataf aḏ genfiɣ. <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ȓexddenni ṯgenfa ḏeg umcan ṯessen belli ddat nnes ṯgenfa zi ȓehȓac nni.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ƹisa isḥess ḏi nnefs nnes belli ijjen n jjheḏ nnes iffeɣ, ineqȓeb ɣar ȓɣaci nni inna-asen: "Wi ḏayi iḥaḏan arruḍ inu?"<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Nnan-as imeḥḍaren nnes: "Xzar mecḥaȓ n yiwḏan iy ḏanita temzaḥamen xak u cek ṯeqqareḏ wi ḏayi iḥaḏan?"<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Walakin iqqim ƹaḏ ixezzar ammu ḏ wammu ḥima aḏ iẓer wi iggin manayenni. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Wami ṯessen ṯemɣarṯ nni min ḏas iweqƹen ṯeggweḏ terjiji, ṯusa-d ṯewḍa ɣar iḍaren nnes ṯƹaweḏ-as marra lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Inna-as: "A yeǧi, cem lʼiman nnem isgenfa-cem. Ruḥ ḏi ȓehna ṯgenfiḏ zi ȓeḥȓac nnem."<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Wami ƹaḏ issawaȓ Ƹisa, usin-d can yiwḏan zi ṯeddarṯ n arrayes nni n ṯemziḏa nnan-as: "Yeǧic cek ṯemmuṯ, mayemmi ƹaḏ ṯseddaƹeḏ lmuƹallim?" <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Isȓa-yasen Ƹisa i min qqaren, inna-as i arrayes nni n ṯemziḏa: "War teggweḏ ca! Itxeṣṣa aḏ tamneḏ waha."<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ssenni war ijji uȓa ḏ ijjen aṯ iḏfar, iḏfar-iṯ ɣir Buṭrus ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna iǧan ḏ umas n Yaƹqub. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Wami uwḍen ɣar ṯeddarṯ n arrayes nni n ṯemziḏa, itwaȓa <char style="it">Ƹisa</char> ḏinni lharaj ḏ yiwḏan trun sɣuyiwen aṭṭas. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Wami yuḏef inna-asen: "Mayemmi ṯesɣuyiwem, mayemmi ṯetrum? Aqa ṯaḥenjirṯ-a war ṯemmuṯ ca, ṯeṭṭeṣ waha!"<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ḍeḥcen xas, ikkar Ƹisa isufeɣ-iṯen marra ssenni. Yuwi akiḏes ḏinni babas ḏ yemmas n ṯḥenjirṯ nni ḏ yinni iruḥen akiḏes. Yuḏef mani ṯeǧa ṯḥenjirṯ nni. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Iṭṭef-as ḏeg ufus i ṯḥenjirṯ nni inna-as: <char style="bd">Ṭaliṯa qumi</char>, iƹni A ṯaḥenjirṯ kkar.<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ȓexddenni ṯekkar ṯḥenjirṯ nni ṯebḏa ṯeggur. Ɣares ṯenƹac iseggwusa. Qqimen tƹejjben aṭṭas. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yumar-iṯen Ƹisa inna-asen war tƹawaḏem i ḥadd min iweqƹen. Ƹaweḏ inna-asen ucem-as aḏ tecc.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Tazzȓen x Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zeg ubilaj nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Iffeɣ ssenni Ƹisa iḏweȓ ɣar ṯmurṯ nnes, ḏfaren-ṯ imeḥḍaren nnes. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada, ibḏa iseȓmaḏ ḏi ṯemziḏa nni. Marra yinni ḏas itsȓan qqimen tƹejjben ḏayes nnan: "Mani yufa manaya? Min ṯeƹna ȓefhameṯ-a iy ḏas immucen? Mammec igga lmuƹjizaṯ-a ig iweqƹen x ifassen nnes? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ma war iǧi ca wanita ḏ anejjar mmis n Maryam umas n Yaƹqub ḏ Yusis ḏ Yahuḏa ḏ Simƹan, suyṯmas aqaṯent ḏanita akiḏneɣ?" X manayenni war ṯ qbiȓen ca.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Nnabi meḥtarem mani ma, walakin ḏeg ubilaj nnes ḏ ȓeḥbab nnes ḏ ṯeddarṯ nnes lla!" <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />War izemmar ca aḏ igg ḏinni lmuƹjiza, ɣir iḥaḏa ḏrus n imehȓac s ifassen nnes isgenfa-ṯen. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Itƹejjeb ȓaḥeqqac lʼiman nsen ḏ uqlil.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ssenni iggur iseȓmaḏ zi dcar ɣar dcar iy ṯ yuḏsen ḏinni.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issekk arrusul aḏ ḥeddṯen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Iȓaɣa-d Ƹisa x ṯenƹac n arrusul issekk-iṯen ṯnayen ṯnayen, yuca-asen ssulṭa aḏ ḥekmen x jnun iƹeffanen. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Iweṣṣa-ṯen inna-asen: "War kiḏwem tawim walu ḏeg ubriḏ, awim akiḏwem ɣir aƹekkaz. War kiḏwem tawim ni aɣrum ni aqrab ni nneḥḥas ḏeg uḥezzam nwem. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Ggeṯ ṯisiȓa, war teggem ca ṯnayen n ičammiren." <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Inna-asen: "Mani ma ṯuḏfem ɣar can ṯeddarṯ, qqimem ḏinni aȓ ɣa ṯuyurem ssenni. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Meȓa war kenniw qbiȓen ca ḏi can umcan niɣ war xsen ca aɣarwem ṣennṭen, ffɣem ssenni mesḥeṯ ṯaƹejjact zeg iḍaren nwem am ca n chaḏeṯ xasen."<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kkaren niṯni ruḥen tḥeddaṯen i yiwḏan ḥima aḏ tuben. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Sufɣen aṭṭas n jnun, ḏehnen i waṭṭas n imehȓac s zzect sgenfan-ṯen.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmewṯ n Siḏna Yaḥya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Azeǧiḏ Hirudus yarra-d ȓexbar x min itegg Ƹisa minzi isem nnes iḏweȓ maƹruf aṭṭas. Ḏinni can yiwḏan qqaren qa wanita iƹni ḏ Yaḥya nni, itwasekkar-d netta zi ȓmewṯ! S manaya iy ɣares jjheḏ iy zi itegg lmuƹjizaṯ-a.<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ijjen iqqar lla qa wanita ḏ <char style="it">nnabi nni</char> Ilyas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Ijjen iqqar lla qa wanita ḏ ijjen n nnabi amecnaw ijjen zi lʼanbiya nni iqḏimen.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Azeǧiḏ Hirudus wami isȓa manaya, inna qa wanita ḏ Yaḥya nni umi qesseɣ azeǧif, aqa itwasekkar-d zi ȓmewṯ!<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-18" />
    <char style="it">Qbeȓ i manaya</char>, azeǧiḏ-a Hirudus imȓec ak yijjen n ṯemɣarṯ qqaren-as Hirudiya. Hirudus netta ḏ aȓwes n Hirudiya. Tuɣa nettaṯ qbeȓ ḏ ṯamɣarṯ n Filippas. Issekk Hirudus aḏ ṭṭfen Yaḥya wami tuɣa ḏas iqqar: Ḥram cek aḏ tawiḏ ṯamɣarṯ n wumac. Iḥebbes-iṯ ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="MRK 6:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Hirudiya ṯenḍar ḏayes ṯiṭṭawin ṯrezzu aṯ tneɣ walakin war ṯzemmar. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Mayemmi? Ȓaḥeqqac Hirudus iteggweḏ zi Yaḥya. Issen belli netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz iǧa nican, ḏ amqeddes. Iḥemma-ṯ Hirudus, iteƹjib-as xmi itḥeddaṯ walakin itɣima istƹejjib ḏayes aṭṭas.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ṯusa-yas-d lfursa i Hirudiya wami igga uzeǧiḏ Hirudus ȓƹiḏ lmilad i yixef nnes igga amensi i imeqqranen nnes ḏ arruyas n ȓƹaskar ḏ imeqqranen n ṯmurṯ n Ljalil. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ṯuḏef-d yeǧis n Hirudiya ṯecḍeḥ, iƹjeb-as ȓḥaȓ i uzeǧiḏ ḏ inewjiwen nnes. Inna-as uzeǧiḏ i ṯḥenjirṯ nni: "Ttar-ayi min ṯexseḏ, aḏam ṯ uceɣ." <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Ijjuǧ-as inna-as: "Min ḏayi ɣa ṯettareḏ aḏam ṯ uceɣ, waxxa azyen n lmemlaka inu."<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ṯeffeɣ ṯenna-as i yemmas: "Min ḏas ɣa ttareɣ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Ṯenna-as yemmas: "Rezzuɣ azeǧif n Yaḥya."<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ȓexddenni ṯeḏweȓ ḏeɣya ɣar uzeǧiḏ, ṯettar zzayes ṯenna-as: "Ȓexxu xseɣ aḏayi ṯuceḏ ḏa azeǧif n Yaḥya x ssiniyyeṯ!" <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ixeyyeq uzeǧiḏ aṭṭas walakin igga-as array ȓaḥeqqac ijjuǧ-as zzaṯ i inewjiwen nnes. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ȓexddenni azeǧiḏ issekk ij uƹessas ɣar ȓeḥbes, yumar-iṯ ḥima aḏ d yawi azeǧif n Yaḥya. Iruḥ uƹessas nni iqess azeǧif n Yaḥya ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Yuwi-ṯ-iḏ x ssinniyeṯ, yuca-as-ṯ i ṯḥenjirṯ nni, ṯaḥenjirṯ nni ṯuca-as-ṯ i yemmas. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Wami sȓin imeḥḍaren n Yaḥya manaya, usin-d ysin ddat nnes ggin-t ḏeg unḍeȓ.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isecc xemsaȓaf n iryazen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Munen arrusul ak Ƹisa ƹawḏen-as x marra min ggin ḏ marra min seȓmaḏen. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Aṭṭas n yiwḏan tasen-d traḥen. <char style="it">Ƹisa ḏ imeḥḍaren nnes</char> war ufin ȓweqṯ waxxa aḏ ccen. X manaya inna-asen: "Araḥem-d waḥeḏwem ɣar yijjen n umcan ixȓa aḏ ṯreyyḥem cwayt." <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ruḥen waḥeḏsen ḏi ṯɣarrabut ɣar yijjen n umcan ixȓa. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ẓrin-ṯen aṭṭas n yiwḏan wami gguren. Ƹeqȓen-ṯen ffɣen ḏeɣya zi marra ibilajen nni tazzȓen marra ḏinni x iḍaren, izwaren-asen ɣar umcan nni. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Wami d iḍra Ƹisa zi ṯɣarrabut yufa ḏinni ȓɣaci nni, qqsen-as minzi ggin amecnaw iḥuȓiyen war ɣarsen ca uw ṯen ɣa yarewsen. Ibḏa iseȓmaḏ-asen aṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Wami iƹḏu ȓḥaȓ, qarrben ɣares imeḥḍaren nnes nnan-as: "Ȓweqṯ ṯeƹḏu, amcan-a ḏ ȓexȓa waha. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Sekk iwḏan-a ɣar ȓedcuraṯ ḏ ṯuḏrin yuḏsen bac aḏ d sɣen min ɣa ccen."<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yarra xasen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ucem-asen kenniw min ɣa ccen."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Nnan-as: "Ma a nraḥ neccin a d nseɣ aɣrum s miyyatayen n ṯpeyyasin n nnuqarṯ, aḏasen ṯ nuc aḏ ccen?"<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Inna-asen: "Cḥaȓ ɣarwem n uɣrum? Ruḥeṯ aḏ texzarem."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Ruḥen ufin cḥaȓ nnan-as: "Ɣarneɣ xemsa n ṯxebbazin ḏ ṯnayen n iseȓman."<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ikkar Ƹisa yumar-iṯen ḥima aṯen sɣimen marra ḏ lfirqaṯ x arbiƹ aziza. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ȓexddenni qqimen ḏ lfirqaṯ xemsin xemsin, miyya miyya. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Iysi xemsa nni n ṯxebbazin ḏ ṯnayen nni n iseȓman iysi ṯiṭṭawin nnes ɣar ujenna uca icekkar Arebbi. Irza aɣrum nni yuca-asen-ṯ i imeḥḍaren nnes ak ṯnayen n iseȓman nni ḥima aṯen ferqen x yiwḏan nni marra. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ccin jjiwnen marra. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ȓexddenni ysin ṯenƹac n ṯeqrabin ƹemmarent s uɣrum iceṭṭen ak iseȓman. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Lƹadad n yinni iccin aɣrum nni niṯni xemsaȓaf n iryazen.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa iggur x ȓemwaj n ȓebḥar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ȓexddenni Ƹisa isney imeḥḍaren nnes ḏi ṯɣarrabut bac aḏ zwan ɣar ujemmaḍ-in n ȓebḥar ɣar ubilaj n Bayt Ṣayda, netta itemsafaḍ x ȓɣaci. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Wami xasen imsafaḍ, netta iruḥ ɣar uḏrar aḏ iẓẓaǧ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ɣar ṯmeddiṯ ṯaɣarrabut aqat ḏi ȓweṣt n ȓebḥar, netta aqaṯ ḏi ȓbarr waḥḏes. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Iẓri-ṯen tqeddafen, tƹeddaben minzi arriḥ itṣuḍ-d zi jjiheṯ nneɣni. Ƹȓayen iqarreb-d ȓefjar, iruḥ Ƹisa ɣar imeḥḍaren nnes iggur x iḍaren x waman n ȓebḥar ixes aṯen iƹḏu. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Wami ṯ ufin iggur x iḍaren x waman n ȓebḥar, tɣir-asen ḏ ȓexyaȓ bḏan snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Marra ẓrin-ṯ ggwḏen. Walakin ḏeɣya inna-asen: "Ahnam! Aqa ḏ nec, war teggwḏem ca!" <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Inya akiḏsen ḏi ṯɣarrabut, irsa arriḥ. Tƹejjben aṭṭas ḏi nnefs nsen <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />mizi tuɣa war fhimen ca lmuƹjiza nni n uɣrum, uȓawen nsen twaqsḥen.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa aṭṭas n yiwḏan ḏi jwayeh n Ganisarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Iẓwa Ƹisa ḏ imeḥḍaren nnes ȓebḥar, uwḍen ɣar ṯmurṯ n Ganisarat qqnen ḏinni ṯaɣarrabut. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Wami ḍrin zi ṯɣarrabut, ȓexddenni ayṯbab n ṯmurṯ nni ƹeqȓen Ƹisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Tazzȓen-d zi ṯamurṯ nni marra, bḏan tawin-d imehȓac x ṯassuṯ ɣar mani sȓin iqqim netta. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Mani ma yuḏef ɣar ibilajen niɣ ɣar ṯneddam niɣ ɣar ȓkampawaṯ, iwḏan srusan imehȓac ḏi ȓeswaq. Tettaren-as aṯen ijj aḏ ḥaḏan ɣir ṭṭarf n warruḍ nnes. Ṣafi marra yinni ṯ iḥaḏan genfan.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Lƹadaṯ nni iy war d yusin ca zi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḏ can imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa zi Lquds munen-d x Ƹisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ẓrin can imeḥḍaren nnes tetten aɣrum bȓa ma aḏ sirḏen ifassen, iƹni bȓa ma aḏ ggen ȓuḍu nni. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ȓaḥeqqac ifarrisiyen ḏ marra Ayṯ-Israʼil meȓa war sirḏen ca ifassen nsen war tetten ca, minzi ṭṭfen aṭṭas ḏi lƹadaṯ n ȓejḏuḏ nsen. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Meȓmi ma d ḏewwȓen zi ssuq, meȓa war sirḏen ca ataf war tetten ca. Aṭṭas n ȓeḥwayej nneɣni iy ḏeffaren, ȓemḏen-ṯen teṭṭfen-ṯen <char style="it">u ṣafi</char>, amecnaw asireḏ n ȓkisan ḏ iɣarrafen ḏ ȓeqcuƹ n nneḥḥas ḏ ṯassuṯ.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Sseqsan-ṯ ifarrisiyen ḏ can imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa nnan-as: "Mayemmi imeḥḍaren nnec war teggen ca lƹadaṯ n ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ? Mayemmi war siriḏen ca ifassen nsen qbeȓ ma aḏ ccen aɣrum?"<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "A lmunafiqin! Qa <char style="it">nnabi</char> Icaƹya inna ȓḥaqq wami xawem issiweȓ ḏeg yijjen n zman:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">&lt;Ccaƹb-a itweqqar-ayi s uqemmum waha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">maca uȓ nnes iggwej xafi.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Iwḏan-a ƹebbḏen-ayi ḏi ȓxawi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">ȓaḥeqqac seȓmaḏen ṯimesȓayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">iǧan ḏ ȓuṣiyaṯ n bnaḏem waha.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Kenniw ṯejjim ȓuṣiyeṯ n Arebbi, ṯeṭṭfem ḏi lƹadaṯ n yiwḏan u ṣafi." <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Inna-asen ƹaweḏ: "Iwa! Tbeṭṭaȓem ȓuṣiyeṯ n Arebbi ḥima aḏ qqiment lƹadaṯ nwem! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa, min inna? Inna: Weqqar babac ḏ yemmac. Aqa wenni ɣa yukkaren babas niɣ ḏ yemmas, ataf itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ immeṯ. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11-12" />Walakin kenniw ṯeqqarem belli war iǧi bu labud i yiwḏan aḏ weqqaren niɣ aḏ ƹawnen lwalidin. Tmenyaṯ nni iy ɣa ucen i lwalidin nsen aṯent ucen i ṯemziḏa. <verse eid="MRK 7:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ammu kenniw ṯbeddȓem ȓmaƹna n wawaȓ n Arebbi ḥima aḏ teggem mammec ḏawem iƹjeb ȓḥaȓ s lƹadaṯ nwem iy ṯȓemḏem. Teggem aṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin amecnaw ṯina."<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Iȓaɣa-d Ƹisa ƹaweḏ x ȓɣaci-ya inna-asen: "Ṣennṭeṯ ɣari marra iḏwem, fehmeṯ: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ma ḏinni ca n ṯmesȓayṯ itaḏfen ḏi bnaḏem zi barra tḥarram-iṯ? Lla, walu. Aqa min d iteffɣen zi bnaḏem aqa ḏ manayenni iy ṯ itḥarramen. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />{Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan!}"<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Wami ijja ȓɣaci, yuḏef ɣar ṯeddarṯ. Sseqsan-ṯ imeḥḍaren x ȓmaƹna-ya min texs aḏ tini. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Inna-asen: "Uȓa ḏ kenniw ƹaḏ war ṯefhimem ca? Ma war ṯessinem belli marra min itaḏfen ḏi bnaḏem zi barra war ṯ itḥarrim ca? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Minzi war itiḏef ca ɣar wuȓ nnes; Lla, itraḥ ɣar uƹeddis iteffeɣ zi ddat." (S manaya Ƹisa yarra marra lmakla ḥalal.) <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Inna-asen: "Walakin min d iteffɣen zeg <char style="it">uqemmum n</char> bnaḏem ḏ manaya itḥarramen bnaḏem. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Mayemmi? Ȓaḥeqqac zi ḏaxeȓ iƹni zeg wuȓ n bnaḏem iy zi d tekkant lʼafkar ṯiƹeffanin ḏ lfasad ḏ ṯukkarḏa ḏ ṯmenɣiwṯ <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ḏ zzna ḏ ṭṭmaƹ ḏ ccarr ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ ḏ ixarwiḍen ḏ ȓeqbaḥeṯ ḏ ṯiṭṭawin n yiwḏan ḏ ttakebbur ḏ ṯubuhȓiya. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Marra ṯimesȓayin-a ṯiƹeffanin teffɣent-id zi ḏaxeȓ n bnaḏem tḥarrament bnaḏem."<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lʼiman n ṯemɣarṯ n Ayṯ-Kanƹan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Ikkar Ƹisa yuyur ssenni iruḥ ɣar jwayeh n ṯendint n Ṣur yuḏef deg yijjen n ṯeddarṯ. Irezzu war itessen ḥadd belli aqaṯ ḏinni walakin iwḏan arrin-d ȓexbar. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ḏinni ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ yeǧis ḏayes jjenn ḏ aƹeffan. Wami d ṯarra ȓexbar ḏeɣya ṯusa-d ɣar Ƹisa ṯewḍa-yas ɣar iḍaren nnes. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ṯamɣarṯ nni ḏ ṯayunaniṯ, lʼaṣel nnes zi Surya Finiqya. Ṯettar zzayes aṭṭas ḥima aḏ isufeɣ jjenn nni aƹeffan zeg yeǧis.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ejj baƹda iḥenjiren aḏ jjawnen. Maci maƹqul aḏ itwakkes uɣrum n iḥenjiren aḏ imenḍar i iqzinen."<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ṯarra xas ṯemɣarṯ nni ṯenna-as: "Ɣarek ȓḥaqq a Siḏi, walakin uȓa ḏ iqzinen nni iǧan swadday n ṭabȓa tetten ifetwitten n uɣrum <char style="it">ig itweṭṭan</char> zeg iḥenjiren."<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ƹlaḥsab awar-a iy ṯenniḏ cem, ruḥ aqa jjenn nni iffeɣ zeg yeǧim." <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Wami ṯeḏweȓ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes, ṯufa yeǧis ṯezzeȓ ḏi ṯassuṯ nnes iffeɣ zzayes jjenn nni.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ijjen n uḏehcur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Iffeɣ Ƹisa ƹaweḏ zi jwayeh nni n Ṣur ikka x ṯmurṯ n Ṣayda, iruḥ ɣar ȓebḥar n Ljalil ḏ lʼiqlim nni umi qqaren Dikaplis. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Uwin-as-d ijjen n uḏehcur ḏ azeynun, ttaren i Ƹisa axas isers fus nnes. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Isbeƹƹed-iṯ Ƹisa x ȓɣaci ɣar yijjen n jjiheṯ nneɣni, igga iḍuḍan nnes ḏeg imejjunen n uryaz nni. Issusef Ƹisa, iḥaḏa-yas iȓes nnes. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Iysi ṯiṭṭawin nnes ɣar ujenna issuḥreṯ inna: "Ifataḥ!" (Awaȓ-a ixes aḏ yini twarzmen.) <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ȓexddenni iy genfan imejjunen nnes iḍȓeq iȓes nnes, ibḏa issawaȓ nican. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Iweṣṣa-ṯen inna-asen war tƹawaḏem manaya i ḥadd. Walakin niṯni mecḥaȓ ma iweṣṣa-ṯen txebbaren xas aṭṭas. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Tƹejjben aṭṭas nnan: "Marra min itegg ḏ aṣebḥan. Itarra ḥetta ḏ iḏehcuren tesȓan, ḥetta ḏ izeynunen ssawaȓen."<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isecc arbeƹaȓaf n yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ḏi ȓiyyam nni, munen-d xas ƹaweḏ ȓɣaci aṭṭas u niṯni war ɣarsen min ɣa ccen. Iȓaɣa-d Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />"Nec qqsen-ayi yiwḏan-a. Ṯeȓtiyyam zeg wami aqaṯen akiḏi war ɣarsen ca min ɣa ccen. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Meȓa ssekkeɣ-ṯen ɣar ṯuḏrin nsen war ccin ca ataf aḏ sexfen ḏeg ubriḏ, ḏinni ca zzaysen usin-d zi ȓeggwaj."<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Nnan-as imeḥḍaren nnes: "Ḏi ȓexȓa-ya mani ɣa naf aɣrum iy zi ɣa nsecc qaƹ lƹadad-a n yiwḏan?"<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Cḥaȓ ɣarwem n uɣrum?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Nnan-as: "Ɣarneɣ sebƹa n ṯecnifin."<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yumar Ƹisa ȓɣaci nni aḏ qqimen ḏi ṯmurṯ. Iṭṭef sebƹa nni n ṯecnifin icekkar Arebbi, irzi-ṯent yuci-ṯent i imeḥḍaren nnes aṯent ferqen x yiwḏan nni. Ȓexddenni ferqen-ṯent. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ɣarsen ḏinni ƹaweḏ ȓebƹaḍ n iseȓman ḏ imezyanen. Ƹisa icekkar Arebbi inna-asen: "Ferqem uȓa ḏ yina x yiwḏan-a." <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ccin jjiwnen, ceṭṭent sebƹa n ṯeqrabin ƹemmarent s iȓeqquzen. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Tuɣa ḏinni can arbeƹaȓaf n yiwḏan. Ssenni imsafaḍ xasen uyuren. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ȓexddenni inya Ƹisa ḏeg yijjen n ṯɣarrabut ak imeḥḍaren nnes iruḥ ɣar jwayeh n Dalmanyuṯa.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwḏan war tefhimen ca min ƹnant lmuƹjizaṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Usin-d ɣares ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen bḏan tmenɣan akiḏes, ttaren zzayes ijjen n lƹalama ṯameqqrant zeg ujenna bac aṯ jarrben. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Iḥreq wuȓ nnes aṭṭas inna-asen: "Mayemmi iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a tettaren lƹalama ṯameqqrant? Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a war ḏasen ticc bu lƹalama ṯameqqrant, qaƹ."<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ijji-ṯen Ƹisa inya ḏi ṯɣarrabut iruḥ ɣar ujemmaḍ-in n ȓebḥar. <verse eid="MRK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Imeḥḍaren ttun aɣrum war ṯ ysin ca, ɣarsen ɣir ijjen n ṯecnifṯ waha ḏi ṯɣarrabut. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Iweṣṣa-aṭen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Cuf! Ḥḍam ixef nwem zeg untun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Antun netta ḏ amṯun.</char></note> n ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḏ untun n uzeǧiḏ Hirudus."<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Bḏan ssawaȓen jarasen nnan qa neccin war ɣarneɣ ḏanita bu uɣrum.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Issen Ƹisa minxef tuɣa ssawaȓen inna-asen: "Mayemmi ṯeqqarem jarawem war ɣarneɣ bu uɣrum? Ma ƹaḏ war ṯessinem? Ma ƹaḏ war ṯefhimem? Uȓawen nwem, ma twaqsḥen niɣ? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ɣarwem ṯiṭṭawin, ma war twiȓim ca niɣ? Ɣarwem imejjunen, ma war tesȓim ca niɣ? Ma war ṯeƹqiȓem ca niɣ? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Wami rziɣ xemsa nni n ṯecnifin i xemsaȓaf nni n yiwḏan, mecḥaȓ n ṯeqrabin iy ṯeccurem s iȓeqquzen iceṭṭen?" Nnan-as: "Ṯenƹac <char style="it">n ṯeqrabin</char>." <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" /><char style="it">Inna-asen:</char> "Iwa ƹaweḏ, wami rziɣ sebƹa nni n ṯecnifin i arbeƹaȓaf nni n yiwḏan, mecḥaȓ n ṯeqrabin iy ṯeccurem s iȓeqquzen iceṭṭen?" Nnan-as: "Sebƹa <char style="it">n ṯeqrabin</char>." <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Inna-asen: "Ma ƹaḏ war ṯefhimem ca?"<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ij uḍarɣaȓ ḏi Bayt Ṣayda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Wami uwḍen ɣar ubilaj n Bayt Ṣayda, uwin-as-d ijjen n uḍarɣaȓ i Ƹisa ttaren zzayes aṯ iḥaḏa. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Iṭṭef aḍarɣaȓ nni s ufus isufeɣ-iṯ ɣar barra n ubilaj nni. Issusef-as x ṯiṭṭawin nnes igga xas ifassen nnes inna-as: "Ma twaȓiḏ can ȓḥajeṯ ma lla?"<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ixzar inna-as: "Twaȓiɣ iwḏan ggin am ȓcejjur gguren-d."<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Igga xas ƹaweḏ ifassen nnes x ṯiṭṭawin n uḍarɣaȓ nni. Ṣafi igenfa, ṯiṭṭawin nnes nurzment ibḏa itwaȓa mliḥ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Issekk-iṯ ɣar ṯeddarṯ nnes inna-as: "War trewwaḥ ca ɣar ubilaj n Bayt Ṣayda."<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Buṭrus icehheḏ x Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Iruḥ Ƹisa netta ḏ imeḥḍaren nnes ɣar ȓedcuraṯ n ṯendint n Qayṣariya n Filippas. Gguren x ubriḏ isseqsa imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen: "Min xafi qqaren yiwḏan?"<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Arrin xas nnan-as: "Ijjen iqqar cek ḏ Yaḥya, ijjen iqqar cek ḏ Ilyas, ijjen iqqar cek zi lʼanbiya."<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Y kenniw, min ḏayi d tarram nec?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as: "Cek ḏ Lmasiḥ."<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Iƹȓem-asen Ƹisa inna-asen: "War qqarem ca manaya xafi i ḥadd."<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issawaȓ x ȓmewṯ nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ibḏa iseȓmaḏ-iṯen inna-asen: "Aqa Mmis n bnaḏem itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ itwaƹeddeb x waṭṭas n ṯmesȓayin, aṯ ƹiffen imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. Aṯ nɣen, wis ṯeȓtiyyam aḏ d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ." <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen nican x manaya. Isbeƹƹeḏ-iṯ Buṭrus inha-ṯ.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Walakin Ƹisa ineqȓeb ɣares ixzar ɣar imeḥḍaren nnes, inha Buṭrus inna-as: "Aggwej xafi ɣar ḏeffar a Cciṭan! Cek war tfekkareḏ ca amecnaw Arebbi; Lla, cek tfekkareḏ amecnaw bnaḏem."<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Iȓaɣa-d x imeḥḍaren nnes ḏ ȓɣaci inna-asen: "Wenni ixsen aḏayi iḏfar nec, labud aḏ ismeḥ ḏeg yixef nnes aḏ ikessi ṣṣalib nnes <char style="it">minxef ɣa iƹeddeb</char> aḏayi iḏfar. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ȓaḥeqqac wenni ixsen aḏ isenjem ṯuḏarṯ nnes ataf at ixsar. Wenni iy ɣa ixsaren ṯuḏarṯ nnes x ssabab inu ḏ ssabab n Lʼinjil ataf at isenjem. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mizi ɣa ṯenfeƹ bnaḏem meȓa irbeḥ ddunect-a qaƹ, wa ixsar ȓaƹmar nnes? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Cuf, bnaḏem war izemmar aḏ ibeddeȓ walu ḏeg umcan n ȓaƹmar nnes. <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Wenni xafi ɣa iƹeffaren nec niɣ aḏ iƹeffar x wawaȓ inu ḏi zman-a aƹeffan ixeddƹen Arebbi, ataf axas iƹeffar Mmis n bnaḏem xmi d ɣa yas s lƹaḍama n Babas ak lmalaʼikaṯ iqeddsen.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Ȓebƹaḍ zeg yinni iǧan ḏa akiḏi war tmettin ca aȓ ɣa ẓren ȓmulk n Arebbi yusa-d s jjheḏ."<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏna Musa ḏ Siḏna Ilyas tmeḍharen-d ak Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ṯeƹḏu settiyyam, Ƹisa yuwi akiḏes Buṭrus ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna yuwi-ṯen waḥeḏsen ɣar yijjen n uḏrar yuƹȓa. Ḏinni zzaṯ i ṯiṭṭawin nsen iḏweȓ am yijjen n nnur. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Iḏweȓ warruḍ nnes ḏ acemȓaȓ ireqq, war izemmar uȓa ḏ ijjen x ṯmurṯ aḏ yarr arruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ am wenni. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Imeḍhar-asen-d ḏinni <char style="it">nnabi</char> Ilyas ḏ <char style="it">nnabi</char> Musa. <char style="it">Twaȓan-ṯen</char> ssawaȓen ak Ƹisa.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as i Ƹisa: "A Siḏi, ḏ aṣebḥan akiḏec neqqim ḏanita. Neccin a negg ṯȓaṯa n iqiḍan, ijjen i cek, ijjen i Musa, ijjen i Ilyas." <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Buṭrus tuɣa ifaja, war yufi ca min ɣa yini, niṯni ggwḏen. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Yusa-d ijjen n useynu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aseynu netta ḏ asegnu.</char></note> ihwa-d xasen. Ṯendeq-d zzayes ijjen n ṯmijja ṯenna-asen: "Qa ḏ wanita ḏ Mmi iƹizzen, ṣennṭeṯ ɣares." <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Wami xzaren imeḥḍaren ammu ḏ wammu, ƹlaɣafla war akiḏsen ufin ḥadd illa Ƹisa.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Wami d hewwan zeg uḏrar iweṣṣa-ṯen Ƹisa inna-asen: "War tƹawaḏem i ḥadd min ṯeẓrim aȓ d ɣa ikkar Mmis n bnaḏem zi ȓmewṯ." <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Jjin awaȓ nni jarasen, ssiwȓen ak wayawya nnan: Kifac, min ixes aḏ yini aḏ d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ?<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Sseqsan-ṯ imeḥḍaren nnes nnan-as: "Mayemmi imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa qqaren itxeṣṣa <char style="it">nnabi</char> Ilyas aḏ d yas netta ḏ amezwaru?"<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ḏ ṣṣaḥ itxeṣṣa aḏ d yas Ilyas ḏ amezwaru aḏ iƹḏeȓ kuȓci. Walakin mayemmi iqqar Lkitab belli itxeṣṣa-yas i Mmis n bnaḏem aḏ itwaƹeddeb, aṯ ƹiffen? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Aḏawem iniɣ: Aqa Ilyas nni yusa-d, xeḏmen ḏayes min xsen mammec xas yura ḏi Lkitab."<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa ij uḥenjir ḏayes jnun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />
    <char style="it">Ƹisa ḏ yinni akiḏes</char> dewȓen-d ɣar imeḥḍaren ufin ḏinni ȓɣaci ḏ ameqqran munen-d xasen. Ufin ƹaweḏ can imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa tmenɣan ak imeḥḍaren nni. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Wami ẓrin Ƹisa, marra ȓɣaci nni ḏehcen uzzȓen ɣares axas seǧmen.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Minxef tmenɣam?"<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Indeq-d yijjen zi ȓɣaci nni inna-as: "A Lmuƹallim, aqa uwiɣ-ac-d mmi ḏayes jjenn ḏ azeynun. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mani ma iṭṭef-iṯ iɣeṭṭaȓ-iṯ ɣar ṯmurṯ, isufuɣ-d netta kuffu zeg uqemmum nnes itɣeẓẓaẓ ṯiɣmas nnes iḏewweȓ war itenhezzi. Ttareɣ zeg imeḥḍaren nnec azzayes sufɣen jjenn nni walakin niṯni war ḏas zemmaren ca."<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yarra xasen Ƹisa inna-asen: "A iwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a iy ḏi war iǧi bu lʼiman! Mecḥaȓ iy kiḏwem ɣa qqimeɣ u mecḥaȓ ḏawem ɣa ṣbareɣ? Awim-ayi-ṯ-id i nec." <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Uwin-ṯ-id ɣar Ƹisa, jjenn nni yallah iẓra Ƹisa iserjiji aḥenjir nni iwḍa ɣar ṯmurṯ, iterjiji itekk-as-d kuffu zeg uqemmum.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Inna-as Ƹisa i babas n uḥenjir nni: "Mecḥaȓ zeg wami iy ḏayes manaya?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Inna-as: "Zeg wami iǧa ḏ amezyan. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin ineṭṭar-iṯ ḏi ṯmessi niɣ ḏeg waman bac aṯ ineɣ. Cek meȓa ṯzemmareḏ, ƹawen-aneɣ rḥem-aneɣ."<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Mayemmi iy ɣa ṯiniḏ meȓa zemmareɣ? Iwa wenni yumnen izemmar i kuȓci."<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ȓexddenni issiweȓ s jjheḏ babas n uḥenjir nni inna-as: "Nec umneɣ! Ƹawen lʼiman inu ḏ uqlil."<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ljumla-ya s ttarjama ḥarfiya "Ƹawen ccekk inu." Ttarjama nnes ṯeqseḥ s ṯmaziɣṯ. Itxeṣṣa a nfekkar mliḥ ḏi ȓmaƹna nnes ḥima a nefhem nican min ixes aḏ yini babas n uḥarmuc-a.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Wami yufa Ƹisa ȓɣaci ḏeɣya munen-d xas, isbedd jjenn nni aƹeffan inna-as: "A jjenn azeynun a jjenn aḏehcur, tamareɣ cek ffeɣ zzayes war ḏayes taḏaf ca ƹemmarṣ ƹaweḏ!" <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ jjenn nni iserjiji aḥenjir nni aṭṭas ȓexddenni iffeɣ zzayes. Aḥenjir nni iḏweȓ axmi immuṯ, nnan aṭṭas n yiwḏan aqa immuṯ ṣafi. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Walakin Ƹisa iṭṭef-iṯ zeg ufus nnes isbedd-iṯ ikkar.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yuḏef Ƹisa ɣar ṯeddarṯ, sseqsan-ṯ imeḥḍaren nnes waḥḏes nnan-as: "Mayemmi zaƹma neccin tuɣa war nzemmar aṯ nsufeɣ?"<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yarra xasen inna-asen: "Nnuƹ <char style="it">n jjenn-a</char> aṯ nsufeɣ ɣir s ṯẓaǧiṯ."<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Ruḥen kkin ssenni x ṯmurṯ n Ljalil. Ƹisa war ixes ḥadd aḏ issen <char style="it">aqaṯen ḏinni</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />minzi irezzu aḏ iseȓmaḏ i imeḥḍaren nnes. Inna-asen: "Mmis n bnaḏem aḏ itwasellem ɣar ifassen n yiwḏan. Aṯ nɣen, nhar wis ṯeȓtiyyam menbaƹd i ȓmewṯ nnes aḏ d ikkar." <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Walakin niṯni war fhimen ca i wawaȓ nni, ggwḏen aṯ sseqsan x min ḏasen inna.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manwen ig iǧan ḏ ameqqran?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Usin-d ɣar ubilaj n Kafernaḥum. Aqaṯen ḏi ṯeddarṯ isseqsa imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen: "Minxef tmenɣam ḏeg ubriḏ?" <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />War xas arrin ca <char style="it">seḏḥan</char> minzi tmenɣan x ubriḏ ak wayawya ug iǧan ḏ ameqqran zzaysen.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Iqqim, iȓaɣa-d x ṯenƹac nni n imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen: "Wenni irezzun aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ amezwaru <char style="it">jarawem</char> itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ yiȓi ḏ aneggaru iƹni ḏ axeddam n marra." <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Isqarreb-d ɣares ij uḥenjir ḏ amezyan, isbedd-iṯ ḏi ȓwesṭ nsen iḏerreƹ-as inna-asen: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />"Wenni ɣa iqebȓen can uḥenjir am wanita ƹlaḥsab isem inu, axmi ḏ nec ig iqbeȓ. Wenni ḏayi ɣa iqebȓen, maci ḏ nec ig iqbeȓ; Lla, iqbeȓ wenni ḏayi d issekken."<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Inna-as Yuḥanna: "A Lmuƹallim, qa neẓra ijjen isufuɣ jnun ƹlaḥsab isem nnec. Neccin nerzu aṯ nesbedd wami war iǧi ca ḏ ameḥḍar akiḏneɣ."<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "War ṯ sbeddam ca. War izemmar can yijjen aḏ igg lmuƹjiza ƹlaḥsab isem inu ȓexddenni ḏeɣya axafi yini awaȓ ḏ aƹeffan. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Wenni war iǧin ca ḍed nneɣ, aqaṯ akiḏneɣ. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Wenni ḏawem ɣa yucen ȓkas n waman ȓaḥeqqac teḏfarem Lmasiḥ ataf aḏ yawi lʼajar nnes war ṯ itḍeyyiƹ ca."<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lʼiman ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Wenni iy ɣa yawin ijjen zeg imezyanen-a iy zzayi itamnen ɣar ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, ḥsen i netta aḏas cedden ijjen n uzru n ṯsirṯ s usɣun ɣar yiri nnes aṯ nḍaren ḏi ȓebḥar. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Cek fus nnec meȓa itsebbab-ac ḏi can ȓefḍiḥeṯ, qess-iṯ zaƹma. Ḥsen i cek aḏ taḏfeḏ jjenneṯ s yijjen n ufus zi meȓa qqimen ɣarek ṯnayen n ifassen aḏ tmenḍareḏ ḏi jahennama ɣar ṯmessi iy war ixessin ca ƹemmarṣ. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />{Qa ḏinni ikeccawen war tmettin ca, ṯimessi war ṯxessi ca.} <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Meȓa ḍar nnec itsebbab-ac ḏi can ȓefḍiḥeṯ, qess-iṯ zaƹma. Ḥsen i cek aḏ taḏfeḏ jjenneṯ s yijjen n uḍar zi meȓa qqimen ɣarek ṯnayen n iḍaren aḏ tmenḍareḏ ḏi jahennama. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />{Qa ḏinni ikeccawen war tmettin ca, ṯimessi war ṯxessi ca.} <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Meȓa ṯiṭṭ nnec tsebbab-ac ḏi can ȓefḍiḥeṯ, qȓeƹ-it zaƹma. Ḥsen i cek aḏ taḏfeḏ jjenneṯ s yijjen n ṯiṭṭ zi meȓa qqiment ɣarek ṯnayen n ṯiṭṭawin aḏ tmenḍareḏ ḏi jahennama. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Qa ḏinni ikeccawen war tmettin ca, ṯimessi war ṯxessi ca. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Minzi marra iwḏan aḏ twameǧḥen s ṯmessi. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Ȓemȓeḥ ṯṣeǧaḥ, walakin meȓa iruḥ-as lmaḏaq nnes, mamc ḏas ɣa negg aḏas ṯiḏ narr? Aɣarwem ṯiȓi ȓemȓeḥ ḏi nnefs nwem, iȓim ḏi ȓehna ak wayawya."<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ṭṭalaq ƹlaḥsab mammec iy ḏaneɣ iqqar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ikkar Ƹisa iffeɣ ssenni iruḥ ɣar jwayeh n Yahuḏiya ḏ ujemmaḍ-in n yiɣzar n Lʼurdun. Munen-d xas ḏinni ȓɣaci ƹaweḏ, ibḏa iseȓmaḏ-iṯen amecnaw ȓebda.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Qarrben-d ɣares can yiwḏan zi ȓḥizeb n ifarrisiyen ḥima aṯ jarrben nnan-as: "Ma ḥalal aḏ iǧef can uryaz i ṯemɣarṯ nnes?"<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Minxef kenniw iweṣṣa Musa?"<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Nnan-as ifarrisiyen: "Musa ismeḥ i uryaz aḏ yari ṯabrat n waǧaf aḏas t yuc i ṯemɣarṯ nnes aḏas iǧef."<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Musa yura ȓuṣiyeṯ nni i kenniw minzi ɣarwem uȓ iqseḥ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Walakin zeg wami ṯebḏa ddunect Arebbi ixȓeq-d aryaz ḏ ṯemɣarṯ. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />S manayenni aryaz aḏ ismeḥ ḏi babas ḏ yemmas aḏ imun ak ṯemɣarṯ nnes, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />aḏ ḏewȓen s ṯnayen iḏsen ḏ ijjen. X manaya war tiȓin ca ḏ ṯnayen; Lla, aḏ iȓin ḏ ijjen. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Iḏen, min ismun Arebbi war ṯ isfarreq ca bnaḏem."<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ḏi ṯeddarṯ sseqsan-ṯ imeḥḍaren nnes ƹaweḏ x manayenni. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Marra wenni ɣa iǧfen i ṯemɣarṯ nnes yuwi can yicten nneɣni, ataf izna. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ṯamɣarṯ meȓa ṯeǧef i uryaz nnes ṯuwi can yijjen nneɣni, ataf ṯezna."<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itbarek iḥenjiren imezyanen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Uwin-d yiwḏan can iḥenjiren ḏ imezyanen ɣar Ƹisa ḥima aṯen iḥaḏa, walakin ƹarrḍen-asen imeḥḍaren nnes. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Iẓra Ƹisa manaya, war ḏas iƹjib bu ȓḥaȓ inna-asen: "Jjem iḥenjiren imezyanen aɣari d asen. War ḏasen tƹarraḍem ca ȓaḥeqqac ȓmulk n Arebbi itiȓi ɣar yinni iy iǧan am yina. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Labud i bnaḏem aḏ yamen s ȓmulk n Arebbi mamc zzayes itamen uḥenjir amezyan. Meȓa lla, ataf bnaḏem nni ƹemmarṣ aḏ yaḏef ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi." <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Iḏerreƹ-asen Ƹisa igga xasen ifassen nnes ibarek-iṯen.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aryaz ig iǧan ḏ ttajar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ƹisa wami iggur x ubriḏ, yusa-d ɣares ijjen itazzeȓ iwḍa x ifadden zzaṯes inna-as: "A Lmuƹallim aṣebḥan, min ɣa ggeɣ ḥima aɣari ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda?"<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Mayemmi ṯeqqareḏ qa nec ḏ aṣebḥan? War iǧi ḥadd ḏ aṣebḥan illa Arebbi waḥḏes. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ṯessneḏ ȓuṣiyaṯ: War neqq, war zenna, war tacar, war cehheḏ bu ẓẓur, war cemmeṯ, weqqar babac ḏ yemmac."<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Inna-as uryaz nni: "A Lmuƹallim, zeg wami iy ǧiɣ nec ḏ amezyan tweqqareɣ qaƹ manaya."<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Ixzar ɣares Ƹisa yuḏef-as ɣar wuȓ nnes inna-as: "Qa ṯeqqim-ac ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ war t ṯeggiḏ ca." Inna-as: "Ruḥ zenz marra min ɣarek ḏ agȓa ṣeddeq-iṯ x ȓmusakin aɣarek yiȓi ȓkenz ḏeg ujenna, ȓexddenni araḥ-d cek ḏfar-ayi-d." <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Wami isȓa i manayenni iruḥ ixeyyeq aṭṭas ȓaḥeqqac ɣares aṭṭas n wagȓa.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Ixzar ɣarsen Ƹisa inna-asen i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Mecḥaȓ iqseḥ xasen x twajar aḏ aḏfen ȓmulk n Arebbi." <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ḏehcen imeḥḍaren nnes x wawaȓ nni. Inna-asen Ƹisa ƹaweḏ: "A ṯarwa inu, mecḥaȓ iqseḥ aḏ yaḏef bnaḏem ȓmulk n Arebbi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Aqa isheȓ aḏ iƹḏu ijjen n uȓɣem zi ṯiṭṭ n ṯseynefṯ qbeȓ ma aḏ yaḏef ijjen n ttajar ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi!"<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Imeḥḍaren tƹejjben aṭṭas nnan i wayawya: "Xyar, ug izemmaren aḏ injem!?"<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Ixzar ɣarsen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Iwḏan war zemmaren ca i manaya. Walakin Arebbi wah, izemmar i kuȓci."<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Indeq-d Buṭrus inna-as: "Aqa neccin nesmeḥ ḏi kuȓci neḏfar-ic!"<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Marra wenni isemḥen ḏi ṯeddarṯ nnes niɣ ḏi ayṯmas niɣ ḏi suyṯmas niɣ ḏi yemmas niɣ ḏi babas niɣ ḏi ṯarwa nnes niɣ ḏeg imarjeƹiwen nnes x ssabab inu nec u ƹlaḥsab Lʼinjil, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ataf aɣares ṯiȓi miyya n ṯseqqar zi ṯuḏrin ḏ ayṯmas ḏ suyṯmas ḏ yemmas ḏ ṯarwa nnes ḏ imarjeƹiwen nnes. Aɣares yiȓi uƹeddeb ḏi zman-a, walakin ḏi zman iy d ɣa yasen aɣares ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Aṭṭas iy iǧan ḏ imezwura aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ ineggura; Yinni iy iǧan ḏ ineggura aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ imezwura."<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issawaȓ ƹaweḏ x ȓmewṯ nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Aqaṯen x ubriḏ tgaƹƹaḏen ɣar ṯendint n Lquds, Ƹisa aqaṯ zzaṯ. Imeḥḍaren nnes ḏehcen, yinni ṯ iḏfaren ggwḏen. Iruḥ yuwi ṯenƹac nni n imeḥḍaren nnes ṯwaȓa nneɣni waḥeḏsen, ibḏa issawaȓ akiḏsen x min ḏas ɣa iweqƹen inna: <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />"Aqa netgaƹƹaḏ ɣar Lquds mani ɣa itwaxḏeƹ Mmis n bnaḏem i arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. Axas ḥekmen s ȓmewṯ, aṯ sellmen i yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Axas ḍeḥcen, axas ssusfen, aṯ uwṯen s usɣun, aṯ nɣen. Nhar wis ṯeȓtiyyam aḏ d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ."<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṭṭaleb n ṯarwa n Zabadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna iy iǧan ḏ ṯarwa n Zabadi qarrben ɣar Ƹisa nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim, nrezzu aḏaneɣ ṯḏebbareḏ min ɣa nettar zzayek."<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Min ṯrezzum aḏawem ḏebbareɣ?"<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Nnan-as: "Ejj-aneɣ a neqqim ḏi lƹaḍama nnec ijjen x ufusi ijjen x uẓeȓmaḍ nnec."<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Kenniw war ṯessinem ca min ṯettarem. Ma ṯzemmarem aḏ teswem zi ȓkas nni iy zi ɣa sweɣ nec? Niɣ aḏ tɣeḍsem ḏi ȓaƹḏab nni iy ḏi ɣa ɣeḍseɣ nec?"<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Nnan-as: "Wah, nzemmar-as!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Wah, ataf aḏ teswem zi ȓkas nni iy zi ɣa sweɣ nec, aḏ tɣeḍsem ḏi ȓaƹḏab nni iy ḏi ɣa ɣeḍseɣ nec. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Walakin aɣimi x ufusi inu niɣ x uẓeȓmaḍ inu war iǧi bu ḏ nec iy ṯ ɣa yucen, aḏ immuc i yinni umi itwassewjeḏ."<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ƹecra nni n imeḥḍaren wami sȓin x min rezzun Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna war ḏasen iƹjib ca ȓḥaȓ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Iȓaɣa-yasen-d Ƹisa marra iḏsen inna-asen: "Qa ṯessnem arruyas n ȓegnus ḥekkmen x ccuƹub nsen, yinni imeqqranen zzaysen tzeyyaren xasen. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Walakin manayenni itxeṣṣa war itiȓi ca jarawem; Lla, wenni irezzun aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ ameqqran jarawem itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ yiȓi ḏ axeddam nwem. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Wenni irezzun aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ amezwaru jarawem itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ yiȓi ḏ ismeɣ n marra. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Mmis n bnaḏem uȓa ḏ netta war d yusi ca ḥima axas xeḏmen yiwḏan; Lla, netta yusa-d ḥima axasen ixḏem, axasen iṣeddeq ṯuḏarṯ nnes ḥima aḏ isenjem aṭṭas zzaysen."<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa isgenfa Bartimus wenni iǧan ḏ aḍarɣaȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Uwḍen ɣar ṯendint n Ariḥa. Menbaƹd iffeɣ Ƹisa zi Ariḥa ak imeḥḍaren nnes ḏ waṭṭas n ȓɣaci. Ufin ḏinni ijjen n uḍarɣaȓ iqqim ṭṭarf n ubriḏ itettar, qqaren-as Bartimus mmis n Timus. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Itesȓa belli Ƹisa Naṣiri iy iƹeddun ssenni ibḏa isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ iqqar: "A Ƹisa a Mmis n Ayṯ-Dawed, rḥem-ayi!" <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Zeyyaren xas aṭṭas n yiwḏan qqaren-as sqar. Netta yugi, iqqim isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ ƹaḏ s jjheḏ iqqar: "A Mmis n Ayṯ-Dawed, rḥem-ayi!"<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Ibedd Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ȓaɣam-d xas."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Ȓaɣan-d x uḍarɣaȓ nni nnan-as: "Fareḥ cek kkar, aqa itȓaɣa-d xak <char style="it">Ƹisa</char>." <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ikkes azeǧab nnes inḍar-iṯ, inexḍef ḏeɣya ibedd x iḍaren nnes yusa-d ɣar Ƹisa.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Min ṯexseḏ aḏac ggeɣ?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Inna-as uḍarɣaȓ nni: "A Siḏi, qa nec xseɣ aḏ twaȓiɣ."<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-as: "Ruḥ, qa lʼiman nnec isgenfa-cek!" Ȓexddenni ibḏa itwaȓa iḏfar Ƹisa ḏeg ubriḏ.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itaḏaf x usnus ɣar ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Wami qarrben ɣar ṯendint n Lquds ɣar ibilajen n Bayt Faji ḏ Bayt Ƹanya zzaṯ i Uḏrar n Zzitun, ikkar Ƹisa issekk ṯnayen zeg imeḥḍaren nnes <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />inna-asen: "Ruḥem ɣar ubilaj-in iy iǧan zzaṯwem. Xmi ɣa ṯawḍem ḏinni, aḏ tafem ij usnus iqqen ƹemmarṣ war xas inyi uȓa ḏ ijjen, fsim-as awim-ṯ-iḏ. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Meȓa issiweȓ-d ɣarwem can yijjen inna-awem mayemmi teggem ammu, inim-as qa iḥḏaj-iṯ Siḏiṯneɣ, walakin aḏawem ṯiḏ yarr ḏanita ḏeɣya."<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ruḥen ufin ijjen n usnus ḏi zzenqeṯ iqqen ɣar yijjen n ṯewwarṯ, fesyen-as. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Nnan-asen ȓebƹaḍ zeg yinni ibedden ḏinni: Min teggem? Mayemmi ṯfessim i usnus-a? <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Jawben-ṯen ƹlaḥsab mammec ṯen iweṣṣa Ƹisa, uca jjin-ṯen. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Uwin-ṯ-iḏ ɣar Ƹisa ggin xas izeǧuba nsen, netta inya xas.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Aṭṭas n yiwḏan ssun-as abriḏ s izeǧuba nsen. Ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen qessen zeg imarjeƹiwen ȓefruƹ n ȓcejjur ssun-as zzaysen abriḏ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Yinni igguren zzaṯes ḏ yinni iy ṯ iḏeffaren qqaren:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">"Lḥamdu i Arebbi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Ssaƹḏ n wanita iy d yusin ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏi Arebbi.<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Ssaƹḏ n ȓmulk nni iy d itasen n jeddiṯneɣ Dawed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Lḥamdu i Arebbi yuƹȓan."<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yuḏef Ƹisa ɣar ṯendint n Lquds ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ixzar min ḏinni marra. Walakin tuɣa iƹḏu ȓḥaȓ, iffeɣ ak ṯenƹac n imeḥḍaren nnes iruḥ ɣar Bayt Ƹanya.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯacejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ iy yuzɣen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ṯiwecca nnes teffɣen zi Bayt Ƹanya, Ƹisa iǧuz. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Iẓra zi ȓeggwaj ijjen n ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ ḏayes ṯifray, iqarreb ɣares irezzu x ṯazarṯ. Wami ɣares yuweḍ yufa ḏayes ṯifray waha minzi ƹaḏ war d ṯuwiḍ ca ȓweqṯ n ṯazarṯ. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Inna-as: "Cem zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent ƹemmarṣ war zzayem itett ḥadd." Imeḥḍaren nnes sȓan-as i min inna.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa aqaṯ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ṣafi uwḍen ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. Yuḏef Ƹisa ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ibḏa itazzeȓ x yinni issaɣen ḏ yinni iznuzan ḏinni ḏi ṯemziḏa. Iqȓeb-asen missaṯ n yinni itṣarrafen tmenyaṯ ḏ ȓekrasa n yinni iznuzan iḏbiren. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />War itijji uȓa ḏ ijjen aḏ ikk x ṯemziḏa meȓa ɣares sseȓƹaṯ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Iseȓmaḏ-iṯen inna-asen: "Ma iqqar Lkitab ma lla belli &lt;Ṯaddarṯ inu aḏ tiȓi ḏ ṯaddarṯ n ṯẓaǧiṯ i marra ȓegnus&gt;? Walakin kenniw ṯarrim-teṯ ḏ ifri n ixewwanen." <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Sȓin-as arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa, bḏan tfekkaren mammec ṯ ɣa nɣen. Ggwḏen zzayes wami marra ȓɣaci qqimen ḏehhcen s useȓmeḏ nnes. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ɣar ṯmeddiṯ teffɣen ɣar barra n ṯendint.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asfhem n ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ nni iy yuzɣen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ɣar sbaḥ zic wami gguren x ubriḏ ẓrin ṯacejjarṯ nni n ṯazarṯ ṯuzeɣ s iẓewran nnes. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Ifekkar ḏayes Buṭrus inna-as i Ƹisa: "Xzar a Lmuƹallim, ṯacejjarṯ nni n ṯazarṯ iy ṯexziḏ aqa ṯuzeɣ!"<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Amnem zi Arebbi! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Meȓa can yijjen inna-as i uḏrar-a: Neqȓeƹ-d cek ssanita ṯmenḍared ḏi ȓebḥar, u ḏeg wuȓ nnes war ḏayes bu ccekk yumen aḏ iwqeƹ manayenni, ataf manayenni aḏ yiȓi. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />X manaya aḏawem iniɣ: Qaƹ min ɣa ṯettarem i Arebbi ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem, amnem belli aḏ tiȓi aɣarwem d ṯaweḍ ataf aɣarwem d tiȓi. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Kenniw xmi ɣa ṯbeddem aḏ teẓẓaǧem, meȓa ɣarwem ca n lƹadawa ak can yijjen semḥem-as ḥima Babaṯwem iǧan ḏeg ujenna aḏawem iɣfar ddnub nwem. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />{Meȓa war ṯsemḥem ca i yiwḏan, Babaṯwem iǧan ḏeg ujenna war ḏawem iɣeffar ca ddnub nwem.}"<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ssulṭa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ṣafi ḏewȓen ɣar Lquds. Ƹisa iggur ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, usin-d ɣares arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Kkaren nnan-as: "Cek manis ḏac d ṯekka ssulṭa nni iy zi teggeḏ ṯimesȓayin-a? Wi ḏac yucin ssulṭa nni iy zi ṯent teggeḏ"<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Ijaweb-iṯen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Uȓa ḏ nec akenniw sseqsiɣ x yijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ. Meȓa ṯjawbem-ayi-d xas, ataf aḏawem iniɣ zi manis ḏayi d ṯekka ssulṭa-ya iy zi teggeɣ ṯimesȓayin-a." <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Yaḥya, man ssulṭa iy zi iṭehhar s waman, ma zi Arebbi ma zeg yiwḏan? Jawbem-ayi-d."<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ssiwȓen jarasen nnan: "Meȓa nenna-as <char style="it">ssulṭa nni</char> qa ṯekka-d zi Arebbi, ataf aḏaneɣ yini Ƹisa mayemmi war zzayes ṯuminem? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Walakin, meȓa nenna-as <char style="it">ssulṭa nni</char> qa ṯekka-d zeg yiwḏan???"</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:32">Ggwḏen niṯni zi ccaƹb <char style="it">aḏ inin amenni</char> minzi qaƹ twaȓan belli Yaḥya netta ḏ nnabi. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Uca nnan-as i Ƹisa: "Neccin war nessin ca."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Iwa uȓa ḏ nec war ḏawem qqareɣ ca manis ḏayi d ṯekka ssulṭa-ya iy zi teggeɣ ṯimesȓayin-a."<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmaƹna n ixemmasen iy ḏi iǧa ccarr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ibḏa Ƹisa issawaȓ akiḏsen s ȓemƹani inna-asen: "Ijjen n ssiyyed iẓẓu aḍiȓ ḏeg yijjen n umarjeƹ nnes. Inneḍ-as-d ȓḥiḍ, igga ḏayes ṯasirṯ uḍiȓ. Ibna ḏayes ijjen n ṯsumƹeṯ i ȓƹasseṯ. Ijja ḏayes ixemmasen ṣafi iruḥ isafar. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Wami d yuweḍ ȓweqṯ n uȓqeḍ n uḍiȓ, ikkar issekk ijjen n uxeddam ɣar ixemmasen nni bac aḏas d ucen ȓḥaqq nnes n umarjeƹ n uḍiȓ. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Walakin min ggin ixemmasen nni? Ṭṭfen-ṯ uwṯin-ṯ, ssekken-ṯ-id ixwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Issekk-asen ƹaweḏ ijjen n uxeddam nneɣni, merzen-as ƹedden xas. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Issekk-asen ijjen nneɣni, nɣin-ṯ. <char style="it">Issekk-asen</char> inneɣni aṭṭas, ijjen uwṯin-ṯ ijjen nɣin-ṯ. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Iqqim-as memmis iƹizzen waḥḏes. Ɣar uneggaru issekk-iṯ ɣarsen inna aqa aḏ ggwḏen memmi. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ixemmasen nni min ggin? Kkaren nnan i wayawya: Aqa wenni iy ɣa iwarṯen! Aṯ nneɣ bac aḏas nawi amarjeƹ-a n uḍiȓ! <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ṭṭfen-ṯ nɣin-ṯ, nḍaren-ṯ-iḏ ɣar barra i umarjeƹ uḍiȓ. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Iwa, min ḏasen ɣa igg bab n umarjeƹ nni uḍiȓ? Aḏ d yas netta s yixef nnes aḏ ineɣ ixemmasen nni marra aḏ ijj amarjeƹ nni uḍiȓ i inneɣni. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ma ƹemmarṣ war ṯeɣrim min yurin ḏi Lkitab?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">&lt;Azru iy ƹiffen ibennayen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">iwqeƹ ḏeg umcan aṣebḥan ḏi ṯɣemmarṯ n dsas.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ḏ Siḏi Arebbi ig iggin manaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">ḏ ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant!&gt;"<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil rezzun aḏ ṭṭfen Ƹisa, walakin ggwḏen zi ccaƹb. Fehmen belli issawaȓ xasen Ƹisa s ȓmaƹna-ya. Jjin-ṯ uyuren ssenni.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ḍḍariba n Qayṣar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Kkaren <char style="it">lḥukkam nni</char> ssekken ɣar Ƹisa can ifarrisiyen ḏ can yiwḏan zi ȓḥizeb n uzeǧiḏ Hirudus, rzun aṯ ṭṭfen x ca n wawaȓ nnes. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Wami d usin ɣar Ƹisa nnan-as: "A Lmuƹallim qa nessen belli cek nican iy ṯeǧiḏ. War teggwḏeḏ ca zeg yiwḏan ȓaḥeqqac war teggeḏ bu s wuḏemawen. Ṯseȓmaḏeḏ s ȓḥaqq mammec ixes Arebbi a nƹic. Ini-yaneɣ: Ma ṯsemmeḥ ccariƹa nneɣ a nxeǧes ḍḍariba i uzeǧiḏ Qayṣar niɣ lla? Ma ḏas t nxeǧes niɣ lla?"<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Issen Ƹisa ixarwiḍen nni iy ḏaysen inna-asen: "Mayemmi ḏayi ṯsewjaḏem ṯaxcebṯ? Awim-ayi-d dinar nni <char style="it">n ḍḍariba</char> ḥima aṯ ẓreɣ." <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ucin-as-ṯ-iḏ. Inna-asen: "Wi yiȓan teṣwirṯ-a ḏ yisem-a iy ḏayes?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Nnan-as: "N Qayṣar."<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Min iǧan n Qayṣar ucem-as-ṯ i Qayṣar. Min iǧan n Arebbi ucem-as-ṯ i Arebbi." Uca qqimen tƹejjben ḏayes.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itbeccar x ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Qarrben-d ɣar Ƹisa can yiwḏan zi ȓḥizeb n iṣadduqiyen (qqaren niṯni belli iwḏan war d tnekkaren ca zi ȓmewṯ). Kkaren nnan-as: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />"A Lmuƹallim, qa yura-aneɣ Musa aryaz meȓa immuṯ ijja ṯamɣarṯ nnes war kiḏes d ijji bu ṯarwa, ṯajjaȓṯ nni labud at yawi uȓwes nnes bac akiḏes d ijj ṯarwa i wumas nni immuṯen. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Neccin tuɣa akiḏneɣ sebƹa n wawmaṯen, imȓec umezwaru immuṯ war d ijji bu ṯarwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ṯamɣarṯ nni yuwi-t wis ṯnayen immuṯ war d ijji bu ṯarwa. Amenni ƹaweḏ wis ṯȓaṯa. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Amenni ƹaweḏ aȓ wis sebƹa, mmuṯen marra war kis d jjin bu ddurriṯ. Aȓ uneggaru uȓa ḏ ṯamɣarṯ nni ṯemmuṯ. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Yum Lqiyama, xmi d ɣa kkaren yinni immuṯen, umi ɣa ṯiȓi ṯemɣarṯ nni? Aqa uwin-t s sebƹa iḏsen."<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Kenniw ṯexḍam ȓaḥeqqac war ṯessinem ca Lkitab, war ṯessinem ca uȓa ḏ jjheḏ n Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Xmi d ɣa kkaren yinni immuṯen <char style="it">iryazen ḏ ṯemɣarin</char> war meǧcen ca war twasmeǧicen ca; Lla, aḏ iȓin amecnaw lmalaʼikaṯ ig iǧan ḏeg ujenna. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Walakin cuf, yinni immuṯen aḏ d kkaren zi ȓmewṯ. Ma ƹemmarṣ war ṯeɣrim min yurin ḏi Lkitab n Musa? Ḏi ȓqiṣṣa n uxcab,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maci maƹruf min iƹna uxcab-a, walakin imken ḏ can arbiƹ am ṯabɣa niɣ am can ṯcejjarṯ ṯamezyant ḏayes isennanen.</char></note> wami issiweȓ Arebbi ak <char style="it">Musa</char> inna-as qa nec ḏ Arebbi n Brahim, ḏ Arebbi n Isḥaq, ḏ Arebbi n Yaƹqub."<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siḏna Musa tuɣa irass ȓebhayem n uḏeggwaȓ nnes netta qqaren-as Yaṯrun, netta ḏ ȓefqi n Midyan. Ijjen n nhar indeh ȓebhayem ɣar ṣṣaḥra ḥetta aȓ mani yuweḍ ɣar uḏrar n Arebbi umi qqaren Ḥurib. Ḏinni iy ḏas d imeḍhar lmalaʼika n Siḏi Arebbi ḏeg uceƹƹaȓ n ṯmessi zi ȓwesṭ n ijjen n uxcab. Yufa Musa axcab nni ireqq bȓa ma aṯ ṯecc ṯmessi. Inna ḏi nnefs nnes: "Aḏ raḥeɣ ḥima aḏ xzareɣ ṯamesȓayṯ-a ig iseḏhacen. Mayemmi axcab-a war iḥerreq ca?" Wami iruḥ ḏinni bac aḏ ixzar, iẓri-ṯ Siḏi Arebbi ibarreḥ-as-d zi ȓwesṭ n uxcab nni inna-as: "A Musa a Musa." Inna-as: "Haqayi." Inna-as Arebbi: "War tqarreb ca ḏanita. Kkes ṯisiȓa zeg iḍaren nnec ȓaḥeqqac amcan-a iy xef ṯbeddeḏ netta ḏ ijjen n ṯmurṯ muqeddasa." Uca inna-as: "Nec ḏ Arebbi n ȓejḏuḏ nnec ḏ Arebbi n Brahim ḏ Isḥaq ḏ Yaƹqub." Ȓexddenni isaḏar Musa aɣembub nnes iggweḏ aḏ iẓer Arebbi.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" /><char style="it">Inna-asen Ƹisa:</char> "Netta ḏ Arebbi n yinni iddaren maci n yinni immuṯen. Aqa kenniw ṯexḍam aṭṭas!"<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyeṯ ṯameqqrant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Yusa-d ijjen zeg imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa isȓa-yasen temnaqacen, yufa belli Ƹisa ijaweb-iṯen mliḥ. Ikkar netta inna-as i Ƹisa: "Min ṯeƹna ȓuṣiyeṯ iy iǧan ḏ ṯameqqrant qaƹ ḏi ccariƹa?"<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Ȓuṣiyeṯ ṯameqqrant ḏ ṯanita: Ṣennṭeṯ ay Ayṯ-Israʼil, Siḏi Arebbi ḏ lʼilah nneɣ, Siḏi Arebbi ḏ ijjen. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Aḏ texseḏ Siḏi Arebbi nnec s marra uȓ nnec, s marra arruḥ nnec, s marra ȓaƹqeȓ nnec, s marra jjheḏ nnec. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ȓuṣiyeṯ wis ṯnayen ḏ ṯanita: Aḏ texseḏ ajjar nnec amecnaw ixef nnec. War ḏinni bu can ȓuṣiyeṯ ktar zi ṯina."<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Inna-as umseȓmaḏ nni n ccariƹa: "A Lmuƹallim mliḥ, min ṯenniḏ ḏ ȓḥaqq. Siḏi Arebbi ḏ ijjen, war ḏinni uȓa ḏ ijjen illa netta. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />U ƹaweḏ meȓa bnaḏem itexs Siḏi Arebbi s marra uȓ nnes ḏ ȓaƹqeȓ nnes ḏ jjheḏ nnes aḏ ixes uȓa ḏ ajjar nnes amecnaw ixef nnes, manaya ḥsen zi <char style="it">bnaḏem meȓa iɣareṣ</char> dbiḥeṯ issecmaḍ-it qaƹ ḏi tmessi niɣ aḏ iqeddem mana ktar <char style="it">i Arebbi</char>."<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yufa Ƹisa aryaz nni ijaweb-iṯ s ȓefhameṯ, inna-as: "War ṯeggwijeḏ ca aṭṭas x ȓmulk n Arebbi." Ssenni war izƹim ḥadd aṯ isseqsa ƹaḏ ktar.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmasiḥ ḏ siḏes n Siḏna Dawed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ƹisa aqaṯ ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant iseȓmaḏ ḏinni. Indeq-d inna-asen: "Mayemmi qqaren imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa qa Lmasiḥ ḏ mmis n Dawed?"<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Mmis n Dawed" war iǧi bu ḏ ijjen n mmis ḏ ṣṣaḥ n Siḏna Dawed; Lla, netta zi ddurriṯ n Siḏna Dawed.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Inna-asen: "Qa Dawed inna netta s yixef nnes s Arruḥ iqeddsen:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:36" />
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:36" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;Siḏi Arebbi inna-as i Siḏi: Qqim-d x ufusi inu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">aȓ d ɣa ggeɣ ȓƹaḏyan nnec swadday i iḍaren nnec.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Mammec ɣa yiȓi Lmasiḥ ḏ mmis n Dawed? Netta Dawed iqqar-as i Lmasiḥ A Siḏi."</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:37" />
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Aṭṭas n ȓɣaci tesȓan-as, farḥen.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmunafiqin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Iseȓmaḏ-iṯen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ḥḍam ixef nwem zeg imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. Niṯni texsen aḏ uyuren s iseȓhamen nni nsen, texsen axasen seǧmen ḏi ȓeswaq, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />texsen aḏ qqimen ḏeg imucan imezwura ḏi ṯemziḏawin ḏ ȓefruḥ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Tetten ṯajjaȓin, smeḍharen-d ixef nsen tẓaǧan aṭṭas ḥima aḏ beyynen i yiwḏan belli niṯni ṣebḥen aṭṭas zaƹma. Yina, lḥisab nsen aḏ yiȓi iqṣeḥ aṭṭas!"<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯajjaȓṯ ṯṣeddeq ṣṣaḏaqa ktar zi twajar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Iqqim Ƹisa <char style="it">ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant</char> zzaṯ i ṣṣenduq nnes. Iẓra mammec ȓɣaci srusan ṣṣaḏaqa nsen ḏi ṣṣenduq nni. Aṭṭas n twajar teggen ḏinni aṭṭas n tmenyaṯ. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ṯusa-d ijjen n ṯajjaȓṯ ḏ ȓmeskina waha ṯegga ḏinni ṯnayen iṣuldan, iƹni ijjen n frank. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Iȓaɣa-d Ƹisa x imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen: "Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Ṯajjaȓṯ-a ḏ ȓmeskina waha ṯegga ḏi ṣṣenduq ktar zi min ggin marra inneɣni. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Minzi marra inneɣni ucin zi min xasen izayḏen ḏ agȓa. Nettaṯ lla, waxxa ḏ ȓmeskina waha ṯṣeddeq marra min ṯeƹȓem."<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Lƹalamaṯ n ȓfana n ddunect</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Wami d iffeɣ Ƹisa zi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant <char style="it">iqarreb-d ɣares</char> ijjen n zeg imeḥḍaren nnes inna-as: "A Lmuƹallim, xzar izra-ya ḏ ȓebni-ya mecḥaȓ ḏ iṣebḥanen!"<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-as: "Twaȓiḏ ȓebni-ya mecḥaȓ d itas ḏ aṣebḥan, yac? Walakin war ḏa itɣimi uȓa ḏ ijjen n uzru x unneɣni, marra manaya aḏ inehḏem."<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Wami iqqim Ƹisa ḏeg Uḏrar n Zzitun zzaṯ i ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, sseqsan-ṯ Buṭrus ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna ḏ Andrus waḥḏes nnan-as: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />"Ini-yaneɣ cek, meȓmi ɣa iwqeƹ manaya? Min ṯeƹna lƹalama nni xmi ƹȓayen ɣa weqƹent marra ṯimesȓayin-a?"<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Ijaweb-iṯen Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ḥḍam ixef nwem ḥima war kenniw ixeddeƹ ḥadd. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Aṭṭas iy d ɣa yasen s yisem inu zaƹma aḏ inin qa nec <char style="it">ḏ Lmasiḥ</char>! Aḏ xeḏƹen aṭṭas n yiwḏan. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Xmi ɣa ṯesȓam x lḥuȓub ḏ ȓexbar n lḥurub war teggwḏeṯ ca, labud zi manaya. Walakin ddunect-a ƹaḏ war ṯfenni ca. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Dduwla aḏ tehjem x dduwla, lmemlaka aḏ tehjem x lmemlaka. Aḏ yiȓi jjuƹ aḏ iwqeƹ zzinzal ḏeg waṭṭas n imucan. Manaya aḏ yiȓi amecnaw ȓeḥriq amezwaru n ṯemɣarṯ itarwen.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Ḥḍam ixef nwem! Akenniw sellmen i lmaḥkamaṯ, akenniw uwṯen ḏi ṯemziḏawin nsen. Aḏ tbeddem zzaṯ i lḥukkam ḏ izeǧiḏen ƹlaḥsab isem inu ḥima axafi ṯcehḏem. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Aqa ḏ amezwaru itxeṣṣa aḏ itwabeccar Lʼinjil i marra ȓegnus. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Xmi kenniw ɣa awin ḥima akenniw sellmen ɣar ccraƹ, bȓa ma aḏ teysim amnus ḏ amezwaru ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem min ɣa ṯinim; Lla, awaȓen nni iy ɣa ṯinim ḏ Arebbi iy ḏawem ṯen ɣa yucen ḏi ṯsaƹƹat nni. War iǧi bu ḏ kenniw iy ɣa issiwȓen; Lla, aḏ issiweȓ Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Umas aḏ isellem umas i ȓmewṯ. Babas aḏ isellem mmis. Ṯarwa aḏ raḥen ḍed i lwalidin nsen, aṯen sellmen i yinni iy ṯen ɣa nɣen. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Akenniw ƹiffen marra iwḏan ƹlaḥsab isem inu, walakin wenni ɣa iṣbaren ɣar uneggaru ataf aḏ injem.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Xmi ɣa ṯeẓrem &lt;min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan aṭṭas iheddmen&gt;, netta ibedd mani ixeṣṣa war itbeddi ca, ȓexddenni yinni iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya itxeṣṣa aḏ arewȓen ɣar iḏurar. (A fhem a wenni iɣrin <char style="it">manaya</char>!) <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Wenni ɣa yiȓin x ṯzeqqa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯazeqqa nettaṯ ḏ ssḍaḥ.</char></note> nnes itxeṣṣa-as war ihewwi ca ɣar ṯeddarṯ, war ḏayes itiḏef ca ḥima aḏ iysi can ȓḥajeṯ. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Wenni ɣa yiȓin ḏeg umarjeƹ itxeṣṣa-as war iteƹqib ca ɣar ṯeddarṯ aḏ iysi čammir nnes. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ya tamara iy ɣa yiȓin x ṯemɣarin nni s iƹeddisen ḏeg wussan nni ḏ ṯinni issuṭuḍen! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ttareṯ i Arebbi bac manaya war itiȓi ca ḏi ȓmecta. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ataf aḏ tewqeƹ ijjen n tamara ḏ ṯameqqrant iy war iweqiƹen ƹemmarṣ zeg wami ṯeǧa ddunect-a iy d ixȓeq Arebbi aȓ ȓexxu, u ƹemmarṣ aḏ tewqeƹ ƹaweḏ. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Maƹlik Siḏi Arebbi war isenqis ca ḏi ȓiyyam nni n tamara-ya iy d ɣa yasen, ataf war inejjem uȓa ḏ ijjen. X ssabab n yinni ixḍar Arebbi, ataf aḏ isenqes ȓiyyam nni iy d ɣa yasen.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ssenni meȓa inna-awem can yijjen: Xzarem! Aqaṯ ḏanita Lmasiḥ! Niɣ, Aqaṯ ḏiha! War ṯ tamnem ca. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Aqa aṭṭas iy d ɣa imeḍharen s ixarriqen aḏ inin aqa nec ḏ Lmasiḥ niɣ nec zi lʼanbiya. Aḏ ggen lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ ṯimeqqranin ḏ ȓaƹjayeb <char style="it">zaƹma</char> ḥima aḏ xeḏƹen iwḏan. Maƹlik zemmaren iȓi xeḏƹen uȓa ḏ yinni ixḍar Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Iȓim ƹlabal kenniw! Aqa nec ƹeȓmeɣ-awem x marra manaya qbeȓ ma aḏ iwqeƹ.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Menbaƹd i tamara n ȓiyyam nni, ȓexddenni ṯfuct aḏ teḏweȓ ḏ ṯaǧest, ṯaziri war ticc bu ṯfawṯ. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Iṯran aḏ d wḍan zeg ujenna, yinni ijehḏen ḏeg ujenna aṯen isenhezz Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Ȓexddenni iy ɣa ẓren Mmis n bnaḏem ihewwa-d ḏeg useynu s lƹaḍama ḏ jjheḏ nnes imɣaren. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Aḏ d issekk lmalaʼikaṯ nnes ɣar arbeƹa n imucan n ṯmurṯ manis d itekk arriḥ: <char style="it">zi ccarq ḏ lɣarb ḏ ljanub ḏ ccamal</char>. Aḏ d ismun yinni ixḍar zi ȓaḥedd n ddunect-a aȓ ȓaḥedd n ujenna.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Ȓemḏem ijjen n ȓmaƹna zi ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ. Ɣir ȓefruƹ nnes aḏ ḥebbben aḏ ggen ṯifray, ataf aḏ tessnem yallah anebḏu iqarreb-d. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Amenni uȓa ḏ kenniw. Xmi ɣa ṯeẓrem ṯimesȓayin-a itewqiƹen ataf aḏ tessnem illa manaya yuḏes-d, aqaṯ zzaṯ i ṯewwarṯ. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Yiwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a war tmettin ca aȓ ɣa iwqeƹ marra manaya. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Aḏ ifna ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ, walakin awaȓen inu war fennin ca ƹemmarṣ.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Cuf, nhar nni niɣ ṯsaƹƹat nni war t issin uȓa ḏ ijjen, lla lmalaʼikaṯ ḏeg ujenna uȓa ḏ Mmis. Issen-it ɣir Baba waḥḏes. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ḥḍam ixef nwem, iȓim ƹlabal ȓaḥeqqac war ṯessinem ca meȓmi d ɣa ṯas ȓweqṯ nni.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Nhar nni aḏ yiȓi am yijjen n ssiyyed irezzu aḏ isafer. Iffeɣ zi ṯeddarṯ nnes, ixeddamen nnes ikellef-iṯen x wagȓa nnes kuȓ ijjen x ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes. Iweṣṣa aƹessas n ṯewwarṯ aḏ iqqim ifaq. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />X manaya faqem baƹda, qa war ṯessinem meȓmi d ɣa iḏweȓ bab n ṯeddarṯ. War ṯessinem ma ag uƹecci niɣ ɣar ȓwesṭ n ǧiȓeṯ niɣ xmi ɣa idden uyaziḍ niɣ ɣar ȓefjar. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ɣarwem aḏ d yas ƹlaɣafla akenniw yaf ṯeṭṭṣem! <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Min ḏawem qqareɣ, qqareɣ-ṯ i marra: Iȓim ƹlabal!"<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯḏehhen Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa s waman n lwarḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Iqqim-as yumayen i Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran n Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ ȓƹiḏ nni umi qqaren Ȓƹiḏ n Ṯefḍirṯ. Arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa rezzun mammec ḏas ɣa ggen ḥima aḏ ṭṭfen Ƹisa s ṯeḥraymiṯ aṯ nɣen. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Nnan jarasen: "Itxeṣṣa war ṯ nteṭṭef ca ḏi Ȓƹiḏ ḥima ccaƹb war itegg ca lfawḍa."<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ƹisa aqaṯ ḏeg ubilaj n Bayt Ƹanya ḏi ṯeddarṯ n yijjen qqaren-as Simƹan bu-jḏam. Wami iqqim ḏinni itett, ṯqarreb-d ɣares ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ɣares ijjen n ṯzeyyat ḏayes aman n lwarḏ iṣfan, iɣȓan s waṭṭas. Ṯerzem-it ṯferreɣ-as-ṯen x uzeǧif nnes. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Can iḏsen zzaysen iqess-asen ȓḥaȓ nnan jarasen: "Mayemmi qaƹ aḍeyyeƹ-a n waman n lwarḏ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ataf aman nni iȓi menzen s yijjen n ttaman ḏ ameqqran ktar zi ṯeȓtmiyya n ṯpeyyasin n nnuqarṯ aḏ mmucent i imesƹan!" Qqimen niṯni nehhan-t aṭṭas.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ejjem-t! Mayemmi t ṯesxeyyaqem? Aqa min ḏayi ṯegga ḏ aṣebḥan aṭṭas. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Imesƹan aqaṯen akiḏwem ȓebda. Meȓmi ma ṯexsem ṯzemmarem aḏaysen ṯeggem ȓxir, nec war kiḏwem tɣimiɣ ca i ȓebda. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ṯegga min xas. Ṯferreɣ-ayi aman-a n lwarḏ x ddat inu ḥima aḏayi ṯsewjeḏ i ṯenḍeȓṯ inu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Mani ma yuweḍ Lʼinjil ḏi ddunect-a amen-ṯekmaȓ, ataf aḏ ƹawḏen x ṯemɣarṯ-a ḏ min ḏayi ṯegga am yijjen n ḏikra xas."<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Uca ikkar Yahuḏa Isxaryuṭi wenni zi ṯenƹac n arrusul iruḥ netta ɣar arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḥima aḏasen izzenz Ƹisa. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Sȓin manaya farḥen weƹḏen-ṯ aḏas ucen tmenyaṯ. Ssenni irezzu Yahuḏa lfurṣa mammec iy ɣa igg aḏasen ṯ izzenz.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amensi n Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran n Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Nhar amezwaru n Ȓƹiḏ n Ṯefḍirṯ, nhar nni iy ḏi ɣarrṣen i ȓƹiḏ, sseqsan imeḥḍaren Ƹisa nnan-as: "Mani ṯexseḏ a nraḥ aḏac nsewjeḏ amensi n Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran?"<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ikkar Ƹisa <char style="it">ixḍar</char> ṯnayen zeg imeḥḍaren nnes issekk-iṯen inna-asen: "Ruḥem ɣar ṯendint, akiḏwem imeȓqa ijjen n uryaz iysi-d aqnuc n waman, ḏfarem-ṯ. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Mani ma yuḏef inim-as i bab n ṯeddarṯ nni, Qa inna-ac lmuƹallim: Mani iǧa uxxam inu iy ḏi ɣa ƹeyyḏeɣ nec ḏ imeḥḍaren inu? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Akenniw yawi ɣar yijjen n ṯɣurfat ḏ ṯameqqrant ṯessu, ṯeƹḏeȓ. Ḏinni iy ḏaneɣ ɣa ṯeswejḏem." <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ruḥen imeḥḍaren nnes uḏfen ɣar ṯendint, ufin nican mamc ḏasen inna. Ṣafi swejḏen amensi n Ȓƹiḏ.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ṯuweḍ-d ṯmeddiṯ, yusa-d Ƹisa ak ṯenƹac n arrusul nnes. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Qqimen tetten inna-asen Ƹisa: "Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Ijjen zzaywem ittet akiḏi aḏayi izzenz."<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Iqqim ḏaysen ȓḥaȓ imeḥḍaren nnes tseqsan-ṯ ij-ij nnan-as: "War iǧi bu ḏ nec, yac?"<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Indeq-d Ƹisa inna-asen: "Ijjen zi kenniw zi ṯenƹac iḏwem, wenni iy kiḏi issisnen ḏi ṭṭebṣi." <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Inna-asen: "Mmis n bnaḏem aḏas iwqeƹ ƹlaḥsab mamc xas iqqar Lkitab, walakin ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ n nni iy ṯ ɣa izzenzen! Ḥsen i netta mȓi war d ixȓiq ca."<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Wami ƹaḏ tetten, iysi-d aɣrum icekkar Arebbi irza aɣrum nni yuca-asen-ṯ i imeḥḍaren nnes inna-asen: "Ysim-ṯ, ḏ wa ig iǧan ḏ ddat inu." <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Iysi-d ȓkas icekkar Arebbi yuca-asen-ṯ, swin zzayes marra iḏsen. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Inna-asen: "<char style="it">Ȓkas-a</char> ḏayes iḏammen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> n ȓƹaheḏ, iƹni ḏ iḏammen inu iy ɣa yazzȓen ƹlaḥsab aṭṭas n yiwḏan. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Aqa tesȓam ȓḥaqq: Zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent war sesseɣ ca zeg waman-a uḍiȓ ḥetta aȓ Nhar nni iy ṯen ɣa sweɣ zi jḏiḏ ḏi ȓmulk n Arebbi." <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ɣennjen ijjen n yizȓi n Ȓƹiḏ, ssenni ffɣen ruḥen ɣar Uḏrar n Zzitun.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa issawaȓ x unkar n Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Inna-asen Ƹisa i imeḥḍaren nnes: "Aḏayi ṯsemḥem marra iḏwem minzi iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">&lt;Aḏ uwṯeɣ wenni irassen iḥuȓiyen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">kuȓ ijjen zi ṯḥimerṯ mani ɣa yarweȓ.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xzar Zakariya (Zacharie) 13:7.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Walakin xmi d ɣa kkareɣ zi ȓmewṯ, aḏawem izwareɣ ɣar ṯmurṯ n Ljalil."<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Inna-as Buṭrus: "Waxxa aḏayec ɣa semḥen marra, nec war ḏayec semḥeɣ ca."<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yarra xas Ƹisa inna-as: "Aqa tesȓiḏ ȓḥaqq: Ṯa, ǧiȓeṯ-a qbeȓ ma aḏ idden uyaziḍ marrṯayen ataf aḏayi ṯenkareḏ ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin."<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Inna-as Buṭrus netta metʼakkad: "Nec war c nekkareɣ ca waxxa akiḏec iy ɣa mmṯeɣ." Amenni iy nnan marra imeḥḍaren.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itẓaǧa ḏeg Uḏrar n Zzitun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Yusa-d Ƹisa ak imeḥḍaren nnes ɣar yijjen n umcan qqaren-as &lt;Gatsimani.&gt; Inna-asen: "Qqimem ḏa, nec aḏ raḥeɣ ḏiha aḏ ẓẓaǧeɣ." <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Yuwi akiḏes Buṭrus ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ Yuḥanna, ibḏa itnexȓeƹ itxeyyaq. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Inna-asen: "Ȓaƹmar inu ƹȓayen aḏ idduqqez s lḥuzen. Qqimem ḏa ṯfaqem." <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ibeƹƹeḏ xasen cwayt, isejjeḏ ɣar ṯmurṯ ibḏa itettar i Arebbi irezzu axas twakkes ṯsaƹƹat nni. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Inna: "A Baba cek kuȓci ṯzemmareḏ-as, sbeƹƹeḏ-iṯ xafi ȓkas-a n ȓaƹḏab. Maci mamc xseɣ nec; Lla, mamc ixes ȓxaḍar nnec cek."<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Iḏweȓ ɣar imeḥḍaren-a yufi-ṯen ṭṭṣen, inna-as i Buṭrus: "Ma teṭṭṣeḏ a Simƹan? Ma war ṯzemmareḏ ca akiḏi ṯfaqeḏ waxxa ḏ ijjen n ṯsaƹƹat waha? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Iȓim ƹlabal ẓẓaǧem ḥima war tiḏfem ca ḏi ȓemḥayen. Uȓ n bnaḏem iwjeḏ walakin ddat nnes ṯeḍƹef." <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ibeƹƹeḏ xasen ƹaweḏ ittar i Arebbi amecnaw amezwaru. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Iḏweȓ-d ƹaweḏ ɣarsen yufi-ṯen ṭṭṣen ȓaḥeqqac iɣelleb xasen yiḍeṣ. Niṯni ƹaweḏ war ufin min ḏas ɣa inin. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Iḏweȓ-d ɣarsen wis ṯeȓt-marraṯ inna-asen: "Ƹaḏ ṯeṭṭṣem, ƹaḏ ṯreyyḥem? Ṣafi, baraka! Aqa ṯuweḍ-d ȓweqṯ nni iy ḏi ɣa itwasellem Mmis n bnaḏem ɣar ifassen n yinni iƹeṣṣan. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Kkarem a nuyurem qa wenni iy ḏayi ɣa izzenzen aqaṯ yusa-d."<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israʼiliyen ḏ irumaniyen teṭṭfen Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yallah Ƹisa issawaȓ yuweḍ-d Yahuḏa, ijjen zi ṯenƹac nni n arrusul nnes. Yuwi-d akiḏes ȓɣaci aṭṭas ysin ȓesyuf ḏ idebbuzen. Ssekken-ṯen-d arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Wenni iy ṯ ɣa izzenzen iƹni Yahuḏa qbeȓ tuɣa itafeq akiḏsen x yijjen n lƹalama inna-asen: Wenni xef ɣa seǧmeɣ ḏ wenni iy xef ṯrezzum. Ṭṭfem-ṯ, awim-ṯ iḥḍa. <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ṣafi yusa-d Yahuḏa iqarreb ɣar Ƹisa inna-as: "A Siḏi." Uca iseǧem xas. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ȓexddenni sersen xas ifassen nsen ṭṭfen-ṯ. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ijjen zeg yinni ḏinni iǧan ijbeḏ-d ssif yuwṯa zzayes ismeɣ n arrayes n ȓfuqaha iqess-as amezzuɣ.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Inna-asen Ƹisa: "Ma tɣir-awem qa nec ḏ lmujrim wami d ṯeysim ȓesyuf ḏ idebbuzen ḥima aḏayi ṯeṭṭfem niɣ? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Tuɣa tɣimiɣ akiḏwem mkuȓ nhar ḏi ṯemzida ṯameqqrant seȓmaḏeɣ ḏinni, war ḏayi ṯeṭṭifem ca. Walakin marra manaya iwqeƹ ḥima aḏ ikemmeȓ min yurin ḏi Lkutub." <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Uca semḥen ḏayes marra arewȓen.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Iḏfar-iṯ ijjen n uḥenjir, xas čammir waha. Ṭṭfen-ṯ <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />walakin netta yarweȓ-asen ḏ aƹeryan ijja ḏinni čammir nnes.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zzaṯ i lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Uwin Ƹisa ɣar arrayes n ȓfuqaha. Munen akiḏes marra arruyas n ȓfuqaha, ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Iḏfar-iṯ Buṭrus zi ȓeggwaj, yuḏef ɣar ȓemraḥ n ṯeddarṯ n arrays nni. Iqqim ak iƹessasen izɣar ɣar ṯmessi. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ marra Jmaƹṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil rezzun chaḏeṯ ḍed i Ƹisa ḥima aṯ nɣen walakin war ufin walu. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Aṭṭas iy xas icehhḏen ẓẓur, walakin ɣarsen tanaquḍ ḏi chaḏeṯ nsen kuȓ ijjen min iqqar. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Kkaren ȓebƹaḍ cehḏen xas ẓẓur nnan: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />"Netsȓa-yas iqqar qa nec aḏ heḏmeɣ ṯamziḏa-ya ṯameqqrant iy bnan yiwḏan s ifassen, aḏ bniɣ ijjen n ṯemziḏa ḏi ṯeȓtiyyam war t bnin yiwḏan s ifassen." <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Walakin ƹaweḏ ɣarsen tanaquḍ ḏi chaḏeṯ nni nsen kuȓ ijjen min iqqar. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Uca ibedd arrays n ȓefuqaha ḏi ȓwesṭ n jmaƹṯ inna-as i Ƹisa: "Ma war ṯeqqareḏ walu cek? Min xac cehhḏen yiwḏan-a?" <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Iqqim Ƹisa isqar war xas yarri ca. Ikkar isseqsa-ṯ ƹaweḏ arrayes n ȓefuqaha inna-as: "Ma cek ḏ Lmasiḥ Mmis n Arebbi iy iǧan mubarik?"<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Inna-as Ƹisa: "Wah, ḏ nec. Kenniw aḏ teẓrem Mmis n bnaḏem iqqim x ufusi n Lqawi. Aṯ ṯeẓrem ƹaweḏ ihewwa-d ak useynu n ujenna."<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Arrays nni n ȓfuqaha iɣareṣ arruḍ x yixef nnes inna-asen: "War neḥḏij bu ȓechuḏ! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ma ṯesȓim-as iqqar lmunkar x Siḏi Arebbi? Min ḏawem imeḍharen?" Marra ḥekmen xas belli isḏaheǧ ȓmewṯ.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ssenni bḏan ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen ssusufen xas. Ȓeḥḥfen-as x uɣembub nnes ccaṯen-ṯ s ȓpunyaṯ qqaren-as: Iwa a nnabi siweȓ! Uwin-ṯ-id iƹassasen ccaṯen-ṯ s iseqqiȓen.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buṭrus inekkar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Buṭrus iqqim ɣar barra awedday ḏi ȓemraḥ. Ṯqarreb ɣares ijjen n ṯxeddant n arrays n ȓfuqaha. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ṯeẓri-ṯ izɣar ɣar ṯmessi, ṯexzar ḏayes mliḥ ṯenna-as: "Uȓa ḏ cek ṯeǧiḏ ak Ƹisa zi Naṣira."<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Inkar Buṭrus inna-as: "War fhimeɣ ca war ssineɣ ca minxef ṯessawaȓeḏ!" Iffeɣ Buṭrus iruḥ ṭṭarf n ṯewwarṯ n ȓemraḥ. {Ȓexddenni idden uyaziḍ.}<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ṯeẓri-ṯ ṯxeddant nni ḏinni ṯenna-asen ƹaweḏ i yinni ibedden ḏeg umcan nni: "Qa aryaz-a wanita zzaysen."<verse eid="MRK 14:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Inkar Buṭrus ƹaweḏ. Menbaƹd cwayt nnan-as yinni ibedden ḏeg umcan nni: "Iwa nican, cek ḏ ijjen zzaysen minzi cek zi Ljalil."<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ikkar Buṭrus ibḏa itḥarrem ixef nnes itjaǧa iqqar-asen: "Aryaz-a iy xef ṯessawaȓem nec war ṯ ssineɣ ca!" <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ȓexddenni idden uyaziḍ ṯwaȓa wis ṯnayen, ifekkar-d Buṭrus awaȓ nni n Ƹisa wami ḏas inna: Qbeȓ ma aḏ idden uyaziḍ marrṯayen aḏayi ṯenkareḏ ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin. Wami ifekkar ḏi manayenni iru imeṭṭawen ḏ imeǧaḥen aṭṭas.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Tawin Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ɣar lḥakem Bilaṭus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Wami iṣbeḥ ȓḥaȓ, munen arruyas n ȓfuqaha, ḏ imeqqranen n Ayṯ-Israʼil, ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa, ḏ marra Jmaƹṯ n lḥukkam nsen mcawaren jarasen. Carfen Ƹisa uwin-ṯ aṯ sellmen i <char style="it">lḥakem arrumani umi qqaren</char> Bilaṭus.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Isseqsa-ṯ Bilaṭus inna-as: "Ma ḏ cek ḏ azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Inna-as Ƹisa: "Aqa ṯenniḏ-t cek."<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Qqimen ḏinni arruyas n ȓfuqaha tahamen-ṯ aṭṭas.<verse eid="MRK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Inna-as Bilaṭus i Ƹisa: "Ma war ṯqarreḏ walu? Qa xzar mecḥaȓ xak tceṯcan!" <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Iqqim Bilaṭus itƹejjeb wami war xasen yarri bu wawaȓ Ƹisa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ḏi mkuȓ Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran inum Bilaṭus iḍeǧeq-asen-d i yijjen n umeḥbus ƹlaḥsab wenni ixes ccaƹb. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ijjen n umeḥbus qqaren-as Barabas ggin-ṯ ḏi ȓeḥbes ak yinni itḥerraben ḍed i ȓmexzen minzi nɣin ijjen n bnaḏem ḏi ȓfawḏa. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Gaƹƹḏen ȓɣaci ɣar Bilaṭus, bḏan tettarren zzayes aḏasen igg min inum itegg-asen.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Inna-asen Bilaṭus: "Ma ṯexsem aḏawem d ḍeȓqeɣ i uzeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil?" <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Issen Bilaṭus belli arruyas nni n ȓfuqaha sellmen-as Ƹisa ȓaḥeqqac ḥesḏen-ṯ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kkaren arruyas nni n ȓfuqaha qeȓben azeǧif i ȓɣaci nni ḥima aḏasen d iḍȓeq i Barabas. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Indeq-d Bilaṭus inna-asen: "Iwa min ḏas ɣa ggeɣ i bnaḏem-a umi ṯeqqarem qa netta ḏ Azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil?"<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ qqaren: "Ṣelleb-iṯ!"<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Inna-asen Bilaṭus: "Mayemmi? Man ljarima ig igga wanita?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Walakin arennin snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ qqaren: "Ṣelleb-iṯ!"<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Bilaṭus wami irezzu aḏ iseƹƹef ȓɣaci nni, iḍȓeq-asen-d i Barabas. Ssenni uwṯin Ƹisa s usɣun isellem-asen-ṯ ḥima aṯ ṣellben x ṣṣalib.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Uwin-ṯ ȓƹaskar ɣar ḏaxeȓ ɣar ȓemraḥ n ȓeqṣar n lḥakem, smunen-d ḏinni marra lfirqa n ȓƹaskar nni. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ggin xas aseȓham ḏ azeggwaɣ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ḏa ḏ lʼaya 20, nzemmar a nini azeggwaɣ niɣ gruna.</char></note> Muḏen-as ijjen n ttaj n isennanen ggin-as-ṯ x uzeǧif nnes. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Bḏan tseǧamen xas qqaren-as ssalam ay azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ccaṯen-ṯ s yijjen n uɣanim ɣar uzeǧif nnes, ssusufen xas, terkaƹen-as tsejjaḏen-as.<verse eid="MRK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawin Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḥima aṯ ṣellben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Wami xas kemmȓen abuṣar, kksen-as aseȓham nni azeggwaɣ ggin-as arruḍ nnes uwin-ṯ ḥima aṯ ṣellben.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Ijjen n uryaz ikka-d zi ȓkampu iƹḏu-d ssenni. Aryaz nni zi ṯendint n Lqurina qqaren-as Simƹan, netta ḏ babas n Iskander ak Arufus. Ggin xas ȓƹaskar ṣṣalib s bezzez ḥima aṯ yarbu.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Uwin Ƹisa ɣar yijjen n umcan qqaren-as &lt;Gulguṭa.&gt; (Ȓmaƹna n yisem-a: Amcan n Jumjuma.) <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ucin-as aman uḍiȓ ixelleṭ ḏaysen ijjen n ddwa ḏ amerzag qqaren-as murr, walakin yugi Ƹisa aṯen isew. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ṣellben-ṯ, ferqen arruḍ nnes jarasen. Ggin lqurƹa ḥima kuȓ ijjen min ɣa iysi. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Tuɣat ḏ tesƹa n ṣbaḥ wami ṯ ṣellben. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" /><char style="it">Ɣar uzeǧif nnes</char> ggin-as ijjen n ṯeȓwiḥet ṯura ḏayes ttuhma nni iqqaren: "Wanita ḏ azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil." <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ṣellben akiḏes ṯnayen n iceffaren, ijjen x ufusi ijjen x uẓeȓmaḍ nnes. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />{S manayenni ikemmeȓ min yurin ḏi Lkitab qa ḥesben-ṯ zi lmujrimin.}<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Iwḏan iy tekken ssenni tukkaren-ṯ thezzan azeǧif nsen qqaren-as: "Ma ḏ cek iy ɣa iheḏmen ṯamziḏa ṯameqqrant at tebniḏ ḏi ṯeȓtiyyam!? <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Nejja ixef nnec hwa-d zeg ujenna zi ṣṣalib-a!"<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Uȓa ḏ arruyas n ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa tbuṣaren xas ƹaweḏ qqaren i wayawya: "Isenjem inneɣni walakin war izemmar ca ȓexxu aḏ isenjem ixef nnes! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Hwa-d a Lmasiḥ ay azeǧiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil ȓexxu zeg ujenna zi ṣṣalib-a ḥima a nẓer manaya azzayek namen!" Amenni ƹaweḏ iy ṯ zawaren lmujrimin nni iy kiḏes ṣellben.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa immuṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ɣar ṯenƹac n uziȓ, ṯehwa-d ṯaǧest x ṯmurṯ amen-ṯekmaȓ aȓ wami ḏ ṯȓaṯa uƹecci. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ɣar ṯȓaṯa uƹecci iȓaɣa Ƹisa s jjheḏ inna: "<char style="bd">Iliy, Iliy, lma sbaqṯani?</char> "Ȓmaƹna n wawaȓ-a: "Ya Arebbi, ya Arebbi, mayemmi ḏayi ṯsemḥeḏ?" <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Sȓin-as ȓebƹaḍ zeg yinni iḥḍaren ḏinni nnan: "Aqa itȓaɣa x nnabi Ilyas." <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ȓexddenni iruḥ ijjen zzaysen iqȓeƹ itazzeȓ, iysi ijjen n spunxa iseɣḏeṣ-it ḏeg waman uḍiȓ ḏ isemmamen, iggi-t x yij ukeccuḍ yuca-as aḏ isew. Inna: "Ȓexxu jjem-ṯ, a nẓer ma aḏ d yas nnabi Ilyas aṯiḏ isihwa!"<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Iȓaɣa Ƹisa s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯemɣar yarra nnefs ṣafi immuṯ. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ȓexddenni ig iqqarṣ arrwaq n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant x ṯnayen zeg ujenna aȓ ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ijjen n uƹaskari ḏ ameqqran n arrumanus ibedd ḏinni zzaṯes iẓra ȓmewṯ ig igga Ƹisa inna: "Aṯarras-a ḏ ṣṣaḥ ḏ Mmis n Arebbi."<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ḏinni can n ṯemɣarin xezzarent-id zi ȓeggwaj, ḏaysent Maryam ṯamagdaliṯ, ḏ Salumi, ḏ Maryam yemmas n Yaƹqub amezyan ḏ Yusis. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Niṯenti tuɣa ḏeffarent-ṯ, tsexxarent xas wami tuɣaṯ iǧa ḏi ṯmurṯ n Ljalil. Ƹaweḏ ḥḍarent akiḏes aṭṭas n ṯemɣarin nneɣni zi ṯinni kis igaƹƹḏen ɣar Lquds.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Neṭṭȓen Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Nhar nni sewjaḏen i nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada. Wami d ṯuweḍ ṯmeddiṯ, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />yusa-d ijjen n uryaz qqaren-as Yusef, zi dcar n Arimatya. Netta ḏ ijjen n uryaz muhim jar Jmaƹṯ n lḥukkam n Ayṯ-Israʼil, itreḥḥab ƹaweḏ zi ȓmulk n Arebbi. Izƹem yuḏef ɣar lḥakem Bilaṭus ittar-as ddat n Ƹisa. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Bilaṭus iḏhec wami isȓa Ƹisa ḏeɣya immuṯ. Iȓaɣa-d x uƹaskari nni ameqqran innas-as ma immuṯ ma ƹaḏ? <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Wami issen Bilaṭus zeg uƹaskari nni Ƹisa immuṯ, isellem ddat nnes i Yusef. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yusef isɣa-d ȓecfen, isehwa-d ddat nnes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iƹni, isehwa-d ddat n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zi ṣṣalib.</char></note> ikeffen-it s ȓecfen. Isers-it ḏeg yijjen n unḍeȓ iɣzin ḏeg uzru <char style="it">igga am yifri</char>. Iseqnunni ijjen n uzru ḏ ameqqran yarri-ṯ x uqemmum n unḍeȓ nni. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maryam ṯamagdaliṯ ḏ Maryam yemmas n Yusis xezzarent mani inḍeȓ.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Wami iƹḏu nhar n ssebṯ n lƹibada, Maryam ṯamagdaliṯ, ḏ Salumi, ḏ Maryam yemmas n Yaƹqub ruḥent sɣint lƹiṭar uwint-ṯ-id aḏas ḏehnent. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Nhar amezwaru n ssimana zic ak ȓefjar ruḥent ɣar unḍeȓ nnes. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Ssawaȓent jarasent <char style="it">ak ubriḏ</char> qqarent: "Wi ḏaneɣ ɣa ikksen azru x uqemmum n unḍeȓ aṯ iseqnunni?" <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Wami xzarent, ufint azru nni itwakkes u netta ḏ ameqqran aṭṭas. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Uḏfent ɣar <char style="it">yifri</char> n unḍeȓ nni ufint ijjen n uḥenjir iqqim x jjiheṯ ṯafusiṯ, igga arruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ u qqiment ḏehhcent aṭṭas.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Inna-asent: "War ḏehhcent ca! Kennint ṯrezzunt x Ƹisa Naṣiri itwaṣellben. Netta war ḏa iǧi ca, ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ. Haqa amcan nnes mani tuɣa ṯ sersen. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ruḥent kennint <char style="it">ȓexxu</char> ɣar imeḥḍaren nnes ḏ Buṭrus inint-asen aqa Ƹisa iruḥ aḏawem izwar ɣar ṯmurṯ n Ljalil akenniw iraja ḏinni. Aṯ tafem ḏinni mammec ɣarwem d iweṣṣa zi qbeȓ." <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ṯimɣarin nni terjijint ḏehhcent, kkarent ruḥent ḏeɣya zeg unḍeȓ nni arewȓent. War ƹawḏent manayenni i ḥadd minzi niṯenti ggwḏent.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itwarfeƹ ɣar ujenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />{Ƹisa wami d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ zic nhar amezwaru n ssimana imeḍhar-d ḏ amezwaru i Maryam ṯamagdaliṯ ṯenni iy zi tuɣa isufeɣ sebƹa n jnun. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ṯruḥ nettaṯ aḏ tsiweḍ ȓexbar-a i yinni tuɣa iǧan ak Ƹisa, ṯufi-ṯen ḥeznen trun. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Wami ḏasen ṯƹaweḏ ṯenna-asen qa ẓriɣ-ṯ iddar, war t uminen ca.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Menbaƹd i manaya imeḍhar-asen-d Ƹisa s yijjen n ṣṣifeṯ nneɣni i ṯnayen iḏsen wami tuɣa gguren ɣar ȓkampu. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ḏewȓen-d aḏ ƹawḏen ȓexbar-a i ayṯmaṯsen, war ṯen uminen ca.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Menbaƹd wami qqimen tetten ḥiṭac n arrusul nnes, imeḍhar-asen-d inha-ṯen minzi lʼiman nsen ḏ uqlil uȓawen nsen qesḥen. Tuɣa niṯni ƹaweḏ war uminen ca yinni iy ṯ iẓrin wami d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Inna-asen: "Ruḥem ɣar marra ddunect, beccarem marra ȓegnus s Lʼinjil. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Wenni yumnen aḏ itwaṭehhar s waman ataf aḏ injem. Wenni war yuminen ca ataf aḏ itwaḥkem. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ḏ ṯina ḏ lƹalamaṯ iy d ɣa imeḍharen ak yinni itamnen: Aqa niṯni aḏ sufɣen jnun ƹlaḥsab isem inu, aḏ ssiwȓen s yiȓesawen ḏ jḏiḏ, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />aḏ ysin ifiɣeran s ifassen nsen. Meȓa swin min ineqqen, ataf war ṯen iḍarri ca. Aḏ sersen ifassen nsen x imehȓac aḏ genfan."<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Issiweȓ akiḏsen Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ssenni itwarfeƹ ɣar ujenna iqqim x ufusi n Arebbi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Niṯni ffɣen beccaren iwḏan ḏi mkuȓ amcan. Siḏiṯneɣ aqaṯ akiḏsen, ismeḍhar-d ȓḥaqq n yinni itbeccaren s waṭṭas n lƹalamaṯ iy ṯen iḏeffaren.}<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>